MONDO:0001397 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "mononeuropathy" ;
    IAO:0000115 "Disease or trauma involving a single peripheral nerve in isolation, or out of proportion to evidence of diffuse peripheral nerve dysfunction. Mononeuropathy multiplex refers to a condition characterized by multiple isolated nerve injuries. Mononeuropathies may result from a wide variety of causes, including ischemia; traumatic injury; compression; connective tissue diseases; cumulative trauma disorders; and other conditions." ;
    mondons:curated_content_resource "https://www.malacards.org/card/mononeuropathy"^^xsd:anyURI ;
