UBERON:0005769 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "basement membrane of epithelium" ;
    IAO:0000115 "An acellular membrane that is part of the epithelium, lies adjacent to the epithelial cells, and is the fusion of the the basal lamina and the reticular lamina." ;
    IAO:0000232 "this class represents a continuous sheet of basement membrane which can underlie multiple epithelial cells over large regions. In contrast, the GO class 'basal membrane' represents a portion of substance on the scale of a single cell." ;
