UBERON:0007376 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "outer epithelium" ;
    IAO:0000115 "The epidermis is the entire outer epithelial layer of an animal, it may be a single layer that produces an extracellular material (e.g. the cuticle of arthropods) or a complex stratified squamous epithelium, as in the case of many vertebrate species[GO]." ;
    IAO:0000116 "this grouping class exists primarily to align with GO - see GO:0008544." ;
    OboInOwl:hasDbXref "BSA:0000073",
