UBERON:0014437 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "iliac crest" ;
    IAO:0000115 "Is part of the pelvis on the edge of the wing of the ilium. Round in shape, dorsal to the pubis and ischium. Acts as structrure that muscles can attach too." ;
