UBERON:0014692 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "superficial epigastric vein" ;
    IAO:0000115 "The superficial epigastric vein is a vein which travels with the superficial epigastric artery. It joins the accessory saphenous vein near the fossa ovalis." ;
    OboInOwl:hasDbXref "FMA:44318",
