UBERON:5001463 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "manual digit 1 plus metapodial segment" ;
    IAO:0000115 "A subdivision of the autopod consisting of manual digit 1 plus the region incorporating a single metapodial element. These segments are typically repeated along the pre-axiom to post-axial axis." ;
    IAO:0000232 "this class represents a series of phalanges plus a metapodial element plus associated soft tissues. Instances of this class typically do not form a distinct unit." ;
