    tara-ap:hasChineseLabel "支正" ;
    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0002386 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "Superficially, the branch of the medial antebrachial cutaneous nerve; deeper, on the radial side, the posterior interosseous nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "neck rigidity, headache, dizziness, spasmodic pain in the elbow and fingers, febrile diseases, mania." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the posteromedial aspect of the forearm, between the medial border of the ulnar bone and the flexor carpi ulnaris muscle, 5 B-cun proximal to the dorsal wrist crease. Note: 1 B-cun distal to the midpoint of the line connecting SI5 with SI8." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-0.8 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Zhizheng" ;
    tara-ap:hasRelatedArtery ILX:0797510 ;
