    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation ILX:0795306 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The seventh intercostal nerve and the terminal branch of the long thoracic nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "pain in the chest and hypochondriac region, asthma, general aching and weakness." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the lateral thoracic region, in the sixth intercostal space, on the midaxillary line. Note: With the subject lying on the side and the arm abducted, SP21 is located at the intersection of the midaxillary line and the sixth intercostal space." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture obliquely 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Dabao" ;
