    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The lateral cutaneous branch of the fifth intercostal nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "fullness and pain in the chest and hypochondriac region." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the anterior thoracic region, in the fifth intercostal space, 6 B-cun lateral to the anterior median line. Note: SP17, ST18 and KI22 are located along the curve of the fifth intercostal space." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture obliquely 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
