    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0016416 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The anterior cutaneous branch of the first intercostal nerve, the medial supraclavicular nerve; the first intercostal nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "cough, asthma, accumulation of phlegm, fullness in the chest and hypochondriac region." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the anterior thoracic region, in the first intercostal space, 2 B-cun lateral to the anterior median line." ;
