    dcterms:description "The Back-Shu Point of the Lung meridian. Back-Shu points are specific points on the back where the qi of the respective zang-fu organs is infused. Situated close to their respectively related zang-fu organs, the Back-Shu points present abnormal reactions to the dysfunction of their corresponding zang-fu organs. They are often used for disorders of the internal organs." ;
