    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The ilioinguinal nerve; deeper, in the inferior aspect, the anterior branch of the obturator nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "lower abdominal pain, hernia, pain in the external genitalia." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the groin region, at the same level as the superior border of the pubic symphysis, and 2.5 B-cun lateral to the anterior median line." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Jimai" ;
