    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0002386 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The posterior and medial antebrachial cutaneous nerves; deeper, the posterior and anterior interosseous nerves." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "deafness, pain in the ear, epilepsy, pain of the arm." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the posterior aspect of the forearm, just radial to the ulna, 3 B-cun proximal to the dorsal wrist crease. Note: TE7 is ulnar to TE6." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-1.0 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Huizong" ;
