    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the anterolateral aspect of the arm, just lateral to the border of the biceps brachii muscle, 4 B-cun inferior to the anterior axillary fold." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-1 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Xiabai" ;
