    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The muscular branch of the anterior thoracic nerve, the lateral cutaneous branch of the second intercostal nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "fullness in the chest and hypochondriac region, cough, hiccup." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the anterior thoracic region, in the sec- ond intercostal space, 6 B-cun lateral to the anterior median line. Note: SP20, ST15 and KI25 are located along the curve of the second intercostal space." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture obliquely 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
