    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Electrical acupuncture therapy via adhesive surface electrodes was used.
Parameters: frequency of 75 Hz, pulse duration of 200 seconds, magnitude of 10 mV.
Auricular acupuncture involved small needles left in place for a week without stimulation.
No manual manipulation or thermal stimulation mentioned.
De qi response not perceivable by patients due to their condition.""" ;
