    tara-kb:hasSampleSizeDetails """Total sample size: 348
Specific sample sizes:
Kwak et al.: 40
Tobbackx et al.: 38
Cameron et al.: 116
Han et al.: 58
Tough et al.: 34
Aigner et al.: 61""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """One RCT used sham acupuncture by penetrating nonacupoints without electronic stimulation.
Another RCT used sham EA by penetrating the same acupoints as real EA but without electrical stimulation.
A third RCT used nonpenetrating dry needling as a sham control.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Kwak (2012): Rotating needles using the index finger and thumb after insertion to a 1.0‚Äì2.0 cm depth using a guide tube.
Tobbackx (2013): Not specified.
Cameron (2011): Electrical.
Han (2011): Electrical.
Tough (2010): Sparrow pecking motion (moving up and down five or six times).
Aigner (1998): Not specified.""" ;
