    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "Not specified (the paper does not provide information on the duration of each acupuncture session or how long the needles were left in place)" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency """Kwak et al.: 6 sessions
Tobbackx et al.: 1 session
Cameron et al.: 12 sessions
Han et al.: 8 sessions
Tough et al.: Not specified
Aigner et al.: Not specified""" .

