    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (the paper does not provide detailed information on the sham procedure)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Electric acupuncture was used in five trials, involving electrical stimulation.
Manual acupuncture was used in three trials, involving manual manipulation of needles.
The needle retention time ranged from 20 to 45 minutes.
No specific sensation was mentioned as being sought during stimulation.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified (the paper does not explicitly mention a TCM term or diagnosis for spasticity)" ;
