    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of treatment: 2 weeks to 2 months
Needle retention time: 20 to 45 minutes""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency """Fink et al., Germany (2004): Manual acupuncture, 30 minutes, twice per week for 4 weeks.
Gong et al., China (2008): Electrical acupuncture, 50 Hz, 5 times per week for 6 weeks.
He and Zhang, China (2008): Electrical acupuncture, 100 Hz (high-frequency group)/2 Hz (low-frequency group), 30 minutes once per day for 30 days.
Lee et al., Korea (2007): Electrical acupuncture, 60 Hz, 20 minutes, 5 times per week for 2 weeks.
Li et al., China (2007): Electrical acupuncture, 1‚Äì100 Hz, 25 minutes once per day for 2 months.
Qu et al., China (2001): Electrical acupuncture, 20 minutes, once per day for 30 days.
Sun, China (2003): Manual acupuncture, once per day for 30 days, including 3 days of rest.
Yan et al., China (2003): Manual acupuncture, 45 minutes once per day for 24‚Äì48 days.""" .

