tara-kb:S-112625-1057 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1057" ;
    dc:title "Clinical Observation on Treatment of Ischemic Apoplexy by Electroacupuncture plus Acupoint Injection" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Scalp acupuncture: Vertex temple anterior oblique line and vertex temple posterior oblique line
Body acupuncture:
Upper limb paralysis: Binao (LI 14), Quchi (LI 11), Waiguan (TE 5), Hegu (LI 4)
Lower limb paralysis: Huantiao (GB 30), Yanglingquan (GB 34), Juegu (GB 39), Weizhong (BL 40)
Facial paralysis: Jiache (ST 6) to Dicang (ST 4)
Aphasia: Lianquan (CV 23)
Dysphagia: Fengchi (GB 20), Wangu (GB 12), Tianzhu (BL 10)
Acupoint injection: Quchi (LI 11), Waiguan (TE 5), Zusanli (ST 36), Juegu (GB 39)""" ;
