    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Local points: bladder 20 to 34, bladder 50 to 54, gallbladder 30, governing vessel 3, 4, 5, 6, Huatojiaji, Shiqizhuixia
Distant points: small intestine 3, bladder 40, 60, 62, kidney 3, 7, gallbladder 31, 34, 41, liver 3, governing vessel 14, 20
Additional points: ear and trigger points chosen individually
Criteria for selection: presence of local or pseudoradicular sensation""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Minimal acupuncture group: superficial needling at nonacupuncture points, serving as a sham intervention.
Waiting list control group: no acupuncture treatment for the first 8 weeks, followed by the same acupuncture treatment as the acupuncture group.""" ;
