    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measures for motor impairment: Scandinavian Stroke Scale (SSS), Rivermead Mobility Index (RMI), Motor Assessment Scale (MAS), Brunnstrom Stages (BS), Fugl-Meyer Assessment-motor score (FMAM), Guidelines on the Use of New Chinese Herbal Medicines in Stroke (UNCHMS guidelines), Modified Edinburgh-Scandinavian Stroke Scale (MESSS)
