    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The stimulation method used in the study is deep dry needling (DDN) with disposable stainless steel needles inserted into taut bands of muscles until a local twitch response (LTR) is obtained. The technique used is the \"fast-in and fast-out\" method described by Hong. No other types of stimulation such as manual manipulation, electrical stimulation, thermal stimulation, or laser stimulation were used." ;
