    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measure: Global assessment by an independent observer at 1, 3, and 6 months after treatment.
Secondary outcome measures: Pain intensity, analgesic intake, quality of sleep, and activity level as recorded in pain diaries.""" ;
