tara-kb:S-112625-1076 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1076" ;
    dc:title "Stage-oriented Comprehensive Acupuncture Treatment plus Rehabilitation Training for Apoplectic Hemiplegia" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Brunnstrom stage I: Guanyuan (CV 4), Neiguan (PC 6), Renzhong (GV 26), Sanyinjiao (SP 6) on both sides; Jiquan (HT 1), Weizhong (BL 40), Chize (LU 5), Hegu (LI 4), Qiuxu (GB 40) on the affected side.
Brunnstrom stage II: Jianyu (LI 15), Quchi (LI 11), Hegu (LI 4), Yuji (LU 10), Futu (ST 32), Yanglingquan (GB 34), Zusanli (ST 36), Jiexi (ST 41), Taichong (LR 3) on the affected side; Quchi (LI 11), Hegu (LI 4), Zusanli (ST 36) on the unaffected side; scalp needling: MS6, MS7, GV 20.
Brunnstrom stages III-IV: Daling (PC 7), Hegu (LI 4), Bizhong (Extra), Chize (LU 5), Tianquan (PC 2), Jianqian (Extra), Futu (ST 32), Liangqiu (ST 34), Xuehai (SP 10), Yinlingquan (SP 9), Sanyinjiao (SP 6), Chengshan (BL 57), Yinbai (SP 1) on the affected side.
Brunnstrom stage V: Scalp needling: MS6, MS9, MS14 on the affected side.""" ;
