Shaohai (HT3): Perpendicular insertion 0.5‚Äì0.8 cun
Shounizhu (Ex-UE): Perpendicular insertion 0.5‚Äì1.0 cun
Zeqian (Ex-UE, A32): Perpendicular insertion 0.5‚Äì1 cun
Control group: Limited to depths of 0.05-0.2 cun""" ;
    tara-kb:hasOCSIAppraisalID tara-kb:O-112625-1077 ;
