    dc:title "Comparison of Superficial and Deep Acupuncture in the Treatment of Lumbar Myofascial Pain: A Double-Blind Randomized Controlled Study" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Shiqizhui (extra 19) located on the posterior middle line of the body
Jizhong (VG 6) located on the posterior middle line of the body
Yangligquan (GB 34) inserted bilaterally
Weizhong (UB 54) inserted bilaterally
Shenmai (UB 62) inserted bilaterally
Four needles inserted in four trigger points or the four most painful muscular tender points in the lumbar area""" ;
