    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Acupuncture combined with electroacupuncture: Needles were stimulated with low-frequency electrostimulation and manual manipulation to evoke "de Chi" sensation.
High-intensity low-frequency TENS: Adhesive electrodes were used for stimulation.
Low-intensity high-frequency subliminal TENS (control group): Stimulation was below the perception threshold, no visible muscle contractions.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not applicable (the paper does not align with TCM terminology or principles)" ;
