Cognitive performance: Global cognitive functioning (Mini Mental State Inventory (MMSE)), Verbal learning and Verbal memory (Rey Auditory Verbal Learning Test (RAVLT)), Visual memory (Facial Recognition Memory), Visual attention (Star Cancellation Test), Visual perception (Time perception), Receptive language (Token test), Word fluency (FAS)
Emotional functioning: Hospital Anxiety and Depression Scale (HADS), Comprehensive Psychiatric Rating Scale (CPRS-Dep)
Secondary outcome measures: Not specified""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each acupuncture session: 30 minutes
Frequency: Twice a week for 10 weeks
Needles left in place during a session: For the entire 30-minute session""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "The frequency of treatment was twice weekly, with each session lasting 30 minutes, over a period of 10 weeks, totaling 20 sessions." .

