tara-kb:S-112625-1084 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1084" ;
    dc:title "Acupuncture Stimulation Improves Balance Function in Stroke Patients: A Single-Blinded Controlled, Randomized Study" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Baihui (GV 20)
Four spirit acupoints: 1.5 cun anterior, posterior, left, and right laterals from Baihui acupoint
Location: On the scalp, just on the periosteum of the skull
Anatomical context: Top of the central sulcus, corresponding to motor and sensory cortex areas related to lower limbs""" ;
