    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (the paper does not use a sham acupuncture group; the control group used subliminal electrostimulation)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Needles were stimulated using both manual manipulation and electrical stimulation (electroacupuncture).
The special needle sensation, "de Chi," was sought during the treatment.
Frequency was preset to 2 Hz, and amplitude was adjusted to elicit visible muscle contractions.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified (the paper does not mention TCM terminology or conditions)" ;
