    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings "No" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measures: motor function (Rivermead Mobility Index), activities of daily living function (Barthel Index), walking ability (time to walk 10 meters), social activities, life satisfaction
