    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "Electrical stimulation (electroacupuncture) was used with a current of 2 Hz applied to specific points (LI 10, SJ 5, GB 31, GB 34) and a current of 100 Hz for scalp acupuncture. The \"Deqi\" sensation was sought." ;
