tara-kb:S-112625-1092 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1092" ;
    dc:title "The Effect of Electro-Acupuncture on Spasticity of the Wrist Joint in Chronic Stroke Survivors" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Hegu (LI 4): in the first dorsal interosseous muscle
Houxi (SI 3): at the ulnar aspect of the fifth metacarpophalangeal joint, at the end of the transverse crease and the junction of dorsal and palmar skin
Waiguan (TW 5): 5.1cm (2in) above the transverse crease on the dorsum of the wrist
Quchi (LI 11): on the radial aspect of the elbow at the origin of the extensor carpi radialis muscle and the radial side of the brachioradialis muscle
Shousanli (LI 10): 5.1cm distal to the LI 11 site on the forearm
Jianyu (LI 15): anterior-inferior to the acromion, on the upper portion of the deltoid muscle""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Crossover design" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "Not applicable (the study used a crossover design without a separate control group)" ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "United States" ;
