    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Body Acupoints:
Jiquan (HT1) along the medial antebrachial cutaneous nerve
Neiguan (PC6) along the medial antebrachial cutaneous nerve
Hegu (LI4) along the superficial branch of radial nerve
Baxie (EX-UE9) consisting of 8 points along the superficial branch of radial nerve and dorsal branch of the ulnar nerve
Baiguan (ST 31) along the lateral cutaneous nerve of thigh
Futu (ST32) along the lateral cutaneous nerve of thigh
Yinlingquan (SP9) along the medial sural cutaneous nerve
Sanyinjiao (SP6) along the medial sural cutaneous nerve
Zusanli (ST36) along the lateral sural cutaneous nerve
Taichong (LV3) along the deep fibular nerve
Scalp Acupoints:
Anterior oblique line of vertex-temporal (MS 6)
Posterior oblique line of vertex-temporal (MS 7)
Additional Acupoints for Specific Conditions:
Central Facial Paralysis: Dicang (ST4), Jiache (ST6), Xiaguan (ST7), Quanliao (SI18)
Dysarthria: Yamen (GV15), Fengchi (GB20), Jinjin (EX-HN12), Yuye (EX-HN13), Lianquan (CV23), Tongli (HT5)""" ;
