    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Ankylosing Spondylitis (AS)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings """Results: The curative rate of the observation group was 40.0%, and the total effective rate was 96.7%; the curative rate of the control group was 10.0%, and the total effective rate was 76.7%. The difference was statistically significant (P<0.05).
Conclusion: Warming needling moxibustion was significantly more effective than electroacupuncture.
Effectiveness: Yes""" ;
