    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "Manual stimulation by bidirectional rotation to induce Deqi sensation. Needles were inserted to a depth of 5 to 20 mm. Deqi is a dull, localized, and aching sensation. No electrical, thermal, or laser stimulation was used." ;
