    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The paper describes several control groups used in the studies reviewed, including sham acupuncture, antiemetic medications, sham needles or ear seeds, and other types of treatment. Specific examples include comparisons like acupuncture versus control, true acupuncture versus sham, and acupuncture versus other treatment versus control." ;
