    tara-kb:hasReportingPublicationID tara-kb:A-112625-1122 ;
    tara-kb:hasSampleSizeDetails """Total participants analyzed: Not specified
Participants within groups: One three-arm RCT: N = 104 (37 electroacupuncture, 33 sham, 34 antiemetic medications)
Two blinded, sham-controlled trials: N = 25 (13 electroacupuncture, 12 sham); N = 38 (20 acupuncture, 18 sham)
Cross-over trial: N = 106 (52 acupuncture, 54 sham)
Auricular acupuncture trial: N = 87 (29 acupuncture, 28 sham needles, 30 sham ear seeds)
Two trials with unclear ROB: N = 246 (127 electroacupuncture plus medications, 119 medications alone); N = 205 (103 acupuncture, 102 sham)
Studies for dyspnea and lower urinary-tract symptoms: N = 47 and N = 30, respectively""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """One study used a nonpenetrating sham procedure compared to penetrating acupuncture to elicit "de qi" sensation.
Another study used sham needles and ear seeds at sham points as part of the control group.
Specific details on needle type, quantity, size, and location are not consistently provided across all studies.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Needles were stimulated using electroacupuncture.
Manual manipulation was used to elicit "de qi" sensation.
Not all studies specified the stimulation method.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified (the paper does not provide a specific TCM term for the condition)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Osteoarthritis" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings "Yes, for chemotherapy-induced nausea and vomiting; No, for other symptoms due to high ROB." ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measures:
Physician's evaluation of joint tenderness
Patient's subjective sensation of pain
Patient's evaluation of degree of joint activity
Physician's evaluation of range of motion
Secondary outcome measures: Not specified""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "Not specified (the paper does not provide specific information on the duration of each acupuncture session or how long needles were left in place)" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Not specified (the paper does not provide explicit information on the frequency of acupuncture treatments)" .

