tara-kb:S-112625-1137 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1137" ;
    dc:title "Treatment of Low Back Pain with Specific Acupoint. A Double-Blind Placebo-Controlled Trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Group A: K3, UB23, UBS2, UBS58, DU3, DU4 (chosen based on TCM for low back pain)
Group B: S41, L9, L13, BAXIE (initial placebo points, considered irrelevant to low back pain according to TCM)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT) Double Blind Placebo Controlled Crossover Trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Group A: Received specific acupuncture points (K3, UB23, UBS52, UBS58) during the first phase and placebo acupoints during the second phase.
Group B: Received placebo acupoints (S41, L9, L13, BAXIE) during the first phase and specific acupuncture points during the second phase.
The placebo acupoints were theoretically irrelevant sites according to TCM, used as a control group.""" ;
