    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group received a standardized educational booklet designed by the British Physiotherapy Association, which included information on causes of back pain, prognosis, and exercises for recovery. Participants were instructed to remain active and received specific back stretching and strengthening exercises, as well as education on relaxation exercises." ;
