    dc:title "Effects of electrical stimulation of acupuncture points on blood pressure" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """LI 4 (Hegu): Located on the dorsum of the hand, between the first and second metacarpal bones and on the radial side of the midpoint of the second metacarpal bone.
