    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Main points: Sanyinjiao (SP 6), Zusanli (ST 36), Ganshu (BL 18), Pishu (BL 20), Shenshu (BL 23), Guanyuan (CV 4), Baihui (GV 20)
