Additional points for specific symptoms:
Severe insomnia: Anmian (Extra), Shenmen (HT 7), Neiguan (PC 6)
Tidal fever with hyperhidrosis: Hegu (LI 4)
Vexation, irritability, palpitation: Taichong (LR 3), Xingjian (LR 2)
Dizziness and headache: Fengchi (GB 20)""" ;
