Total participants analyzed: 156""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (the study did not include a sham acupuncture group)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "Manual manipulation to elicit de-qi sensation; intermittent manual stimulation; infrared irradiation for thermal stimulation." ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified (the paper does not provide a specific TCM term for the condition being studied)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Hot flashes" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings "Yes" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measure: Mean change in the average 24-hour hot flash score at week 4 from baseline.
Secondary outcome measure: Mean change in menopause-related symptoms as estimated by the Menopause Rating Scale questionnaire at week 4.""" ;
