    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Sham procedure: Mock electrical stimulation via surface electrodes connected to a Chinese electro-acupuncture stimulator.
Details: Delivered a weak sound and a light flash at a frequency of 2 Hz but no current to the surface electrodes.
Initial tactile sensation: Weak electrical pulses at the start, then interrupted.
Non-penetrating: No actual electrical stimulation or needle penetration.
Appearance: Continued light and sound stimuli to mimic ongoing stimulation.""" ;
