tara-kb:S-112625-1232 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1232" ;
    dc:title "Clinical Observation on Treatment of Acquired Paralytic Strabismus by Acupuncture Plus Oral Administration of Chinese Herbs" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Main points:
Jingming (BL 1) and Tongziliao (GB 1) for paralysis of the internal and external rectus muscles.
Shangming (Ex HN) and Chengqi (ST 1) for paralysis of the superior and inferior rectus muscles.
Jingming (BL 1) for paralysis of the musculus obliquus superior and inferior.
Jingming (BL 1), Shangming (Extra), Chengqi (ST 1), and Yangbai (GB 14) for oculomotor paralysis.
Auxiliary points:
Fengchi (GB 20), Waiguan (TE 15), Hegu (LI 4), Taiyang (EX HN 5), Cuanzhu (BL 2), and Yifeng (TE 17) for wind invading the meridians.
Fengchi (GB 20), Neiguan (PC 6), Taiyang (EX HN 5), Hegu (LI 4), Weishu (BL 21), Pishu (BL 20), and Zusanli (ST 36) for wind phlegm.
Sanyinjiao (SP 6) and Taichong (LR 3) for endogenous wind.
Zusanli (ST 36), Yangfu (GB 38), Hegu (LI 14) for stagnation of blood.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group consisted of 38 cases of acquired paralytic strabismus treated only with oral administration of Chinese herbs." ;
