tara-kb:S-112625-1236 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1236" ;
    dc:title "Treatment of Plantar Fasciitis in Recreation al Athletes: Two Different Therapeutic Protocols" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Painful points were chosen based on symptoms and diagnosis.
A combination of up to 12 points was used from a list of around 20 effective points.
Specific acupoints mentioned include Daling (PC 7) and Hegu (LI 4).
Table 2 contains a list of effective acupoints, but the content is not specified.
Figure 5 likely contains specific acupoint locations, but the content is not specified.
The table on page 5 lists the following acupoints: Bladder 31, 54, 58, 60, 62; Stomach 36; Large intestine 4; Daling PC 7; Spleen 5; Kidney 7,8; Triple Burner 5; Liver 2,3; Gallbladder 30, 34, 37, 38.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "Control Group: Placebo acupuncture, where six acupuncture needles were inserted to a depth of 2-4 mm in areas with no acupuncture points, without causing a needling sensation." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Greece" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
