    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings """Result: "In the treatment group, 24 cases were cured, 8 cases markedly effective, 5 cases improved, and 3 cases failed, with a total effective rate of 92.5%. In the control group, 9 cases were cured, 12 cases markedly effective, 8 cases improved, and 11 cases failed, with a total effective rate of 72.5%. There was a statistically significant difference in the therapeutic effects between the two groups (=3.3259, P=0.0009)."
