tara-kb:S-112625-126 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-126" ;
    dc:title "Trigger point acupuncture treatment of chronic low back pain in elderly patients -a blinded RCT" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Traditional Acupuncture Points: BL23, 25, GB30, BL40, 60, GB34
Ah Shi Points: Near BL54, 31, 32 (chosen based on tenderness)
Trigger Points: Quadratus Lumborum, Iliopsoas, Piriformis, Gluteus Maximus, Iliocostalis Lumborum, Gluteus Minimus, Hamstring, Other
Needle Depth: Superficial (about 3mm), Deep (20mm into the muscle)
