    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol "Fengchi (GB 20)located in the hollow between the sternocleidomastoid muscle and the upper trapezius muscle; needle inserted perpendicularly with tip pointed to the contralateral inner canthus; Taiyang (EX HN5)reference point for sensation during treatment" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group received 0.4 g Ibuprofen, t.i.d.; 10 mg Flunarizine, Q.N. for 14 consecutive days. This is a specific intervention involving medication, not acupuncture or a waitlist." ;
