tara-kb:S-112625-1296 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1296" ;
    dc:title "Two Sets of Acupoint Combination of Similar Functions Engage Shared Neural Representation: A Functional Magnetic Resonance Imaging Study" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Group A: Waiguan (TES), Qiuxu (GB40)
Group B: Neiguan (PC6), Taichong (LR3)
Locations: Upper and lower extremities
Meridian affiliations:
TES: Hand-Shaoyang Meridian
GB40: Foot-Shaoyang Meridian
PC6: Hand-Jueyin Meridian
LR3: Foot-Jueyin Meridian
Needle insertion depths:
GB40: 1 cm
TES: 1.8 cm
LR3: 1 cm
PC6: 1.5 cm
Twisting technique: 90¬∞ to 180¬∞ at 0.5 to 2.0 Hz""" ;
