    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (no sham acupuncture group was used in the study)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The stimulation involved manual manipulation of the needles, specifically twirling, lifting, and thrusting within a range of 90¬∞ -180¬∞ and at a rate of 0.5-2.0 Hz. The stimulation aimed to induce \"De-qi sensations\" such as soreness, numbness, fullness, and heaviness, but not sharp pain." ;
