Involvement of the rostral anterior cingulated cortex (rACC)
Significant differences in the posterior cingulated cortex (PCC)
Secondary outcome measures:
Shared brain regions involved in both groups (insula, amygdala, hypothalamus)
Differences in brain regions activated between groups""" ;
