tara-kb:S-112625-1301 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1301" ;
    dc:title "Electromyographic evaluation of the masseter and temporal muscles activity in volunteers submitted to acupuncture" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Local action points: Stomach 4 (S4)near the labial comissure
Stomach 6 (S6)a thumb distally to the ear, on the salience of the masseter muscle, close to the lower jaw angle
Stomach 7 (S7)distally to the zygomatic bone, in an undercut formed when the mouth is closed, in the incisura mandibulae
Thin intestine 19 (T119)in the anatomical depression localized in the region anterior to the tragus, formed when the mouth is opened
Governor vase 26 (GV26)in the filter of the upper lip, between the nose and the upper lip, on the median line
Vase of conception 24 (VC24)below the lower lip, in the supramentale concavity on the sagittal median line
Large intestine 20 (L120)between the nasolabial sulcus and a half thumb from the ala of the nose
Long distance action points:
Gall bladder 34 (GB34)in the upper third of the lateral face of the leg, in a muscular undercut localized below and in front of the fibula head
Liver 3 (L3)in the dorsum of the foot, in the space between the first and the second metatarsus
Stomach 36 (S36)three thumbs from the anterior ledge of the tibial epiphysis and a thumb laterally to the anterior edge of the tibia
Large intestine 4 (L14)in the middle of the second metacarpus, between the first and the second metacarpus bones on the muscular prominence formed by the adduction of the thumb
Thin intestine 3 (TI3)in the plica of the ventral flexion, next to the metacarpus falangial joint, when the fist is clenched
Local action points associated to the long distance action points: Association of the points previously described.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Not specified (the paper does not explicitly state the trial type, but it appears to be a controlled trial with randomization)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "Not applicable (the study does not include a separate control group; baseline measurements are used for comparison)" ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Brazil" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "S 4, S 6, S 7, T 119, GV 26, VC 24, L 120, GB 34, L 3, S 36, L 14, TI 3" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupointsMapped TARA:0829128,
        TARA:1429314,
        TARA:2990862,
