    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol "Fixed protocol: ST 36, LI 11, KI 3, SP 6; Imbalance specific points: Lung imbalance: LU 9 and SP 3; Spleen imbalance: SP 3 and PC 7; Liver imbalance: LV 8 and KI 10; Kidney imbalance: KI 7 and LU 8; Symptom specific points: Fatigue or weakness: CV 4, CV 6, BL 20, BL 23; Nausea or vomiting: PC 6, SP 4, CV 12; Oral or dental pain: ST 7, ST 6, TB 17; LI 4 or ST 43; Lower limb pain: GB 34, ST 34, SP 10, SP 9, GB 39 to GB 41, ST 41, SP 5, LV 4, BL 58 and BL 60; Control needling points: ST 38, BL 61, GB 32, KI 20, TB 11, GB 42" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Pilot Study with elements of a Controlled Trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "Control needling: a sham acupuncture control involving shallow insertion of needles at points not typically used for treating HIV related symptoms (ST 38, BL 61, GB 32, KI 20, TB 11, GB 42)." ;
