tara-kb:S-112625-1313 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1313" ;
    dc:title "Clinical Study on Treatment of Senile Vascular Dementia by Acupuncture" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Sishencong (EX HN1): Inserted horizontally to a depth of 1 cun.
Renzhong (GV 26): Obliquely punctured towards the nasal septum to a depth of 0.3 0.5 cun.
Neiguan (PC 6): Perpendicularly inserted to a depth of 0.5 1 cun.
Sanyinjiao (SP 6): Punctured subcutaneously along the medial edge of the tibia to a depth of 1.5 cun at a 45¬∞ angle.
Fenglong (ST 40): Punctured perpendicularly to a depth of 0.5 1.0 cun.
Three temporal points: Located 2 cun above the hairline over the ear tip, with one point anterior and one posterior to the first point, inserted at an angle of 15 20¬∞ to a depth of one cun.
Warming moxibustion points: Baihui (GV 20), Shenmen (HT 7), Shenque (CV 8), Zusanli (ST 36).""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group was treated with piracetam at a dose of 0.8g three times a day." ;
