    tara-kb:hasMappedWesternCondition MONDO:0002009 ;
    tara-kb:hasNeedlingDetails """At Baihui: 2 3 cm
At Yintang: 2 3 cm
On limbs: 25 35 mm""" ;
    tara-kb:hasOCSIAppraisalID tara-kb:O-112625-1316 ;
    tara-kb:hasReportingPublicationID tara-kb:A-112625-1316 ;
    tara-kb:hasSampleSizeDetails """Total participants: 61
Electro acupuncture group: 30
Maprotiline group: 31""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (no sham acupuncture group was used in the study)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The stimulation method used was electroacupuncture, with electrical stimulation applied to acupuncture needles using a computer controlled stimulator. The stimulation involved specific treatment modalities with wave frequencies of 12, 10, 8, and 6 Hz. The sensation of De Qi was sought during the stimulation." ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Yu syndrome; Liver Qi stagnation with Spleen deficiency, Heart Spleen deficiency, Liver kidney yin deficiency" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Major Depression" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings """"There were no significant differences in HRSD and SDS scores between EA and MP groups before and after treatment."
"The scores of anxiety somatization syndrome and SAS for the EA group after treatment were significantly lower than these of the MP group."
"The scores for the Asberg Rating Scale of the MP group were significantly higher than those of the EA group."
"EA was as effective as MP in the treatment of major depression and improved the course of depression without side effects."
"EA appears to be superior to western medicine in alleviating the somatic complaints caused by major depression."
Yes""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measures:
Hamilton RatingScale for Depression (HRSD 24)
Self RatingScale for Depression (SDS)
Clinical Global ImpressionScale (CGI)
Secondary outcome measures:
Self RatingScale for Anxiety (SAS)
Asberg RatingScale forSide Effects""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each acupuncture session: 10 minutes for ADI, AD2, and EAA modalities; 15 minutes for MCE
Duration needles were left in place: Not specified""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Not specified" .

