tara-kb:S-112625-1328 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1328" ;
    dc:title "Observations on the Therapeutic Effects of Acupuncture on Vascular Dementia" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Selection based on TCM syndrome differentiation
Reinforcing method used for deficiency syndrome at Guanyuan (CV 4), Taixi (KI 3), and Taibai (SP 3)
Reducing method used for excess syndrome
Blood letting with a three edged needle at Dazhui (GV 14) or Fenglong (ST 40)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group received oral administration of Duxil, a medication containing 30mg Almitrine bismesylate and 10mg Raubasine, taken twice a day for 60 days. This group did not receive acupuncture." ;
