    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified (the paper does not explicitly state a TCM disease or condition name)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Vascular Dementia" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings """"The total effective rate was 85.3% in the observation group and 62.5% in the control group with a significant difference between the two groups (P<0.05)."
"In the observation group, the score according to MMSE was 16.71+3.64 before the treatment and 20.94 + 4.58 after the treatment, with a significant difference between them (P<0.01)."
"After treatment, the observation group was superior in intelligence to the control group (P<0.05)."
"For the ability to function in daily life, there was a very significant difference before and after the treatment (P<0.01) in the observation group, and there was a significant difference (P<0.05) in the control group."
"After treatment there was a significant difference between the two groups (P<0.05). The observation group was superior to the control group in improvement of the ability to function in daily life."
"It is concluded that combined selection of the source point and the collateral point plus Duxil can improve intellectual level and the ability to take care of oneself in daily life of vascular dementia patients, and was superior to Duxil in the short term therapeutic effect."
Yes""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measures: Total effective rate, MMSEScores, Ability to function in daily life
Secondary outcome measure: HDSScores""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "30 minutes (duration of each session); Needles retained for 30 minutes with manipulation every 10 minutes" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "The treatment was administered once each day for 6 consecutive days with an interval of one day, 60 days constituting one course." .

