tara-kb:S-112625-1344 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1344" ;
    dc:title "Remote Therapeutic Effectiveness of Acupuncture in Treating Myofascial Trigger Point of the Upper Trapezius Muscle" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """TE-5 (Waiguan): Located in the extensor indicis muscle of the dorsal forearm between the radius and ulna, 3 cm superior to the dorsal transverse wrist crease.
LI-11 (Qu-chi): Located in the extensor carpi radialis longus muscle on the lateral side of the cubital crease when the elbow is at its full flexion.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Placebo control (PC) group: This group received a placebo treatment, which is a non-active intervention used as a control to compare the effects of the other groups.
Simple needling (SN) group: This group received a simple needling technique, which can be considered a comparison group to assess the effectiveness of the modified AcP technique.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
