    dc:title "Acupuncture Treatment of Bulbar PalsyA Report of 54 Cases" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Tiantu (CV 22): Punctured perpendicularly with a depth of 0.2 cun, then inserted horizontally downward along the presternum for 2.5 2.8 cun.
Lieque (LU 7): Punctured obliquely upward for 1.0 cun.
Zhaohai (KI 6): Punctured perpendicularly for 0.5 0.8 cun.
Adjunct acupoints: Not specified.""" ;
