    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Main acupoints: Tianshu (ST 25), Huaroumen (ST 24), Wailing (ST 26), Xiawan (CV 10), Shimen (GV 5)
Adjuvant points: Quchi (LI 11), Zhigou (TE 6), Xuehai (SP 10), Futu (ST 32), Liangqiu (ST 34), Zusanli (ST 36), Fenglong (ST 40), Yinlingquan (SP 9), Sanyinjiao (SP 6)
Needle insertion: Filiform needles inserted perpendicularly for a depth of 1.5 2.0 cun
Manipulation: Uniform reinforcing reducing method for main points; uniform reinforcing reducing manipulation to induce local soreness and distension for adjuvant points""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group consisted of 60 cases who were instructed to take 2 bags of Kang Er Shou Diet Tea daily and avoid carbohydrate food for a month." ;
