    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings "Yes, the acupuncture intervention was effective compared to the control group based on the primary outcome of body weight index reduction, with statistical significance (P<0.05)." ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measures: Reduction in body weight, reduction in waist circumference, reduction in body weight index.
Secondary outcome measure:Sustainability of weight loss (recurrence rates).""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each session: 30 minutes
Number of sessions: 15 sessions
Frequency: Once every other day""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "The treatment was given once every other day with 15 treatment sessions as one therapeutic course. Each session lasted for 30 minutes." .

