    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group consisted of 25 participants who received Sibutramine Hydrochloride Capsules orally. This medication inhibits food intake by affecting serotonin and noradrenaline reuptake, and it has known side effects such as insomnia, palpitation, increased blood pressure, tachycardia, and dependence." ;
