    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Obesity" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings """"The total effective rate was 92.0% in the treatment group and 84.0% in the control group."
"The level of serum leptin after treatment obviously declined as compared to that before treatment in the 2 groups (P<0.01) with the treatment group superior to the control group (P<0.05)."
"Acupuncture treatment can effectively reduce the level of higher leptin in serum, which may be one of the mechanisms for acupuncture."
Yes""" ;
