    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """BA Group: EX B3, BL22 (Sanjiaoshu), BL21 (Weishu), BL25 (Dachangshu), BL27 (Xiaochangshu), BL20 (Pishu), BL24 (Qihaishu), BL28 (Pangguangshu), BL23 (Shenshu), RN4 (Guanyuan)
LA Group: ST36 (Zusanli), SP6 (Sanyinjiao), LII1 (Quchi), ST37 (Shanjushu), ST44 (Neiting), SP4 (Gongsun), SP8 (Diji), SP9 (Yinglingquan), KI2 (Rangu), KI3 (Taixi), KI10 (Yingu)
AA Group: ST25 (Tianshu), CV12 (Zhongwan), ST24 (Huaroumen), ST26 (Wailing), CV9 (Shuifen), SP15 (Daheng), SP14 (Fujie), CV6 (Qihai), CV4 (Gongyuan), KI16 (Huangshu)
Back shu points: Located at the first lateral line of the Urinary Bladder Channel of Foot Taiyang on the back and waist.
EX B3: Located 10 cm under the eighth dorsal vertebrae, correlated with the pancreas.""" ;
