    tara-kb:hasSampleSizeDetails """Total participants: 135
BA group: 45
LA group: 45
AA group: 45""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (no sham acupuncture group was used in the study)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """BA Group: Needles were stimulated through manual manipulation (lifting, thrusting, swirling, rotating) and electro stimulation with a discontinuous wave.
LA Group: Needles were stimulated through common acupuncture methods and electro stimulation with a discontinuous wave.
AA Group: Needles were stimulated through manual manipulation (slow lifting and thrusting with slight rotation) and electro stimulation with a discontinuous wave.
Desired sensation was sought in all groups.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Simple Obesity: Gastrointestinal excess heat, Spleen asthenia with excessive dampness, Asthenic spleen yang" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Simple Obesity" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings """"In the BA group: The immediate recovery rate was 44.45%, and the total effective rate was 97.78%; In the LA group: The immediate recovery rate was 46.67%, and the total effective rate was 95.56%; In the AA group: The immediate recovery rate was 41.44%, and the total effective rate was 82.22%."
"The BA group was close to the LA group in both the immediate recovery rate and total effective rate (P > 0.05), and both of them were better than the AA group (P< 0.01)."
"All the indexes, namely weight, BMI, WHR, showed significant reduction in each of the three groups compared with the data before the treatment (P< 0.01)."
"The BA and LA group had similar decrease in the aspects of weight and BMI (P > 0.05), and both were better than the AA group (P< 0.01); All three groups showed a similar decrease in WHR (P> 0.05)."
"Conclusion: Acupuncture on the back shu of the bladder meridian of foot taiyang of female patients with simple obesity meets a similar efficacy with acupuncture on the limbs, and they are both better than abdominal acupuncture."
Yes""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measures: Weight, BMI, WHR
Secondary outcome measures: NotSpecified""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each acupuncture session: 30 minutes
Duration needles were left in place: Not specified""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Daily, at 14:00 18:00; each period consists of 15 treatments with a 5 day break between periods." .

