    dc:title "Observation of Sympathomimetic Effect of Ear Acupuncture Stimulation for Body Weight Reduction" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Experimental group: hunger, stomach, lung, sanjiao
Control group: sham points near eye, frontalis, clavicle, finger
Innervation: great auricular nerve, auricular temporal nerve, vagus nerve
Criteria: based on literature and clinical experience""" ;
