    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group in this study was a sham-point control group. Participants in this group received sham acupuncture at points near the eye, frontalis, clavicle, and finger, which are not linked to internal organs. The study was designed as a crossover study, where participants who initially received sham points later received true acupoints and vice versa." ;
