    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group received the same drug administration as the treatment group (Mifepristone and Misoprostol) but did not receive acupuncture or moxibustion. They were also given the soft extract of Motherwort (Herba Leonuri) after the sac was ejected." ;
