Secondary outcome measures: Reduction in analgesic intake""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "30 minutes (duration of each acupuncture session); Needles left in place for 30 minutes during a session." ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Acupuncture and placebo treatments were administered twice weekly, with each session lasting for a half-hour period. On average, eight needles were used per session, stimulated manually until the 'teh 'chi' sensation was elicited, and then left in place for 30 minutes." .

