tara-kb:S-112625-1430 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1430" ;
    dc:title "Decrease of pregnant women's pelvic pain after acupuncture: A randomized controlled single-blind study" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """BL 27: The level of 1st sacral foramina, 1.5 cun lateral to the dorsal body midline
BL 28: The level of 2nd sacral foramina, 1.5 cun lateral to the dorsal body midline
BL 29: The level of 3rd sacral foramina, 1.5 cun lateral to the dorsal body midline
BL 31: The level of 1st sacral foramina, between BL 27 and the dorsal body midline
BL 32: The level of 2nd sacral foramina, between BL 28 and the dorsal body midline
BL 54: The level of hiatus sacralis, 3 cun lateral to the dorsal body midline
KI 11: 2 cun caudal to the umbilicus, 0.5 cun lateral to the ventral body midline
CV 3: In the ventral body midline, 4 cun caudal to the umbilicus
SP 6: 3 cun proximal to the most prominent point of the medial malleolus
LR 2: Between the 1st and the 2nd metatarsal bone
LI 4: At the middle, radial side of the 2nd metacarpal bone in the highest point of m. interosseus dorsalis with the thumb adducted""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "Not applicable (the paper does not include a control group)" ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Sweden" ;
