tara-kb:S-112625-1437 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1437" ;
    dc:title "Effect of acupuncture on assisted reproduction" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Before embryo transfer: PC6 (Inner Pass), SP8 (Earth's Crux), LR3 (Great Rushing), GV20 (Hundred Convergences), ST29 (Return)
After embryo transfer: S136 (Leg Three Li), SP6 (Three Yin Intersection), SP10 (Sea of Blood), Li4 (Joining Valley)
Chosen based on previous study by Paulus et al.
Related to spleen and stomach meridians for better blood perfusion and energy to the uterus.
PC6, LR3, GV20 relax the patient during the procedure.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Acupuncture: Sham acupuncture
Homeopathy: Usual care plus placebo""" ;
