tara-kb:S-112625-1439 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1439" ;
    dc:title "External Application of Chinese Medicine following Tapping Using a Plum blossom Needle for Allergic Rhinitis" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Feishu (BL 13): Selected as a key point for respiratory system conditions.
Gaohuang (BL 43): Acts to tonify lung qi.
Dazhui (GV 14): Acts to lift yang qi and decrease acidophilic cells.
Pishu (BL 20): Acts to strengthen the spleen, resolve phlegm, benefit the kidney and warm yang.
Shenshu (BL 23): Acts to strengthen the spleen, resolve phlegm, benefit the kidney and warm yang.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Observation group: External application of Chinese medicine following tapping using a plum blossom needle.
Chinese medicine group: Application of Chinese medicine without plum blossom needle tapping.
Point application group: Same method as observation group without plum blossom needle tapping.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Not specified" ;
