Blood gases
Secondary Outcome Measures:
Decrease inSystolicPulmonary arteryPressure (SPAP)
Improvement in airwayPermeability
Improvement inPulmonary hemodynamics
Improvement in diaphragm mobility""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of treatment period: 7 10 sessions, performed daily except on weekends
Duration of each acupuncture session: Needles were left in place for 5 20 minutes""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "The frequency of treatment was daily, except on weekends, with 7 10 sessions. Each session lasted 5 20 minutes." .

