tara-kb:S-112625-1452 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1452" ;
    dc:title "Attenuation of exercise-induced asthma by acupuncture" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Real acupoints:
Dingchuan (extra 17): 0.5 cun lateral to the mid point between the C7 and T1 spinous processes.
Kongzui (L6): 7 cun above the wrist crease on the radial aspect of the forearm.
Taixi (K3): Midway between medial malleolus and tendo calcaneus.
Sham acupoints:
Jianwaishu (S114): 3 cun lateral to the T1 spinal process.
Ximen (P4): Between palmaris longus and flexor carpi radialis, 2 cun below kongzui.
Xuanzhong (G39): 3 cun above the external malleolus, posterior to the fibula.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Control group: No acupuncture was performed before the first run, serving as a baseline.
Sham acupuncture group: Sham points were used as a placebo control to compare with real acupuncture.""" ;
