    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The stimulation involved manual manipulation of the needles every 3 4 minutes during the 15 minute treatment period. No electrical stimulation (electroacupuncture) or thermal stimulation (moxibustion) was used. Sensations of heaviness, achiness, or tingling were sought as indicators of correct needle placement." ;
