    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Bronchial Asthma" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings "Yes, real acupuncture was found to be effective compared to the control/sham group(s) in partially reversing methacholine induced bronchospasm, with statistical significance (p values <0.05) for improvements in specific airway conductance and thoracic gas volume." ;
