General health related quality of life (SF-36).
Days absent from work.
Mean number of treatment sessions.
Mean duration of treatment.
Days with physical therapy because of back pain.
Number of days with pain medication.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of needles left in place: 25 minutes
Duration of each acupuncture session: Not specified""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency """Frequency: Twice weekly
Number of treatments: 10 to 15 sessions
Duration of each treatment: Approximately 25 minutes
Duration of therapy per week: Standardized group: 41.1 minutes, Individualized group: 44.4 minutes""" .

