    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Tianliao (SJ15): Located on the Sanjiao Meridian of Hand Shaoyang
Shentang (BL44): Located on the lateral line of the Bladder Meridian of the Foot Taiyang
Geguan (BL46): Located on the lateral line of the Bladder Meridian of the Foot Taiyang
Chosen based on TCM diagnosis of Bi syndrome to dredge meridians and collaterals, activate blood circulation, and promote Qi circulation to relieve pain.""" ;
