    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group is the perpendicularly needling group. This group is used as a comparison to evaluate the effectiveness of the Qici method with long needles. The perpendicularly needling method involves quick insertion and withdrawal of needles to a depth of 15 20mm, and it is used to compare the therapeutic effects with the Qici method." ;
