Secondary outcome measures: Objective assessment of range of motion (goniometer), relation of hypnotic susceptibility to subjective improvement""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each acupuncture session: 14 minutes, 15 to 20 minutes, 12 minutes
Needle retention time: 30 minutes
Frequency of sessions: 3 times/week for 4 weeks, once daily for 10 or 20 days, twice daily for 56 days
Number of sessions: 12 sessions, 10 or 20 sessions, 24 sessions""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Varied across studies; examples include 3 times/week for 4 weeks, once daily for 10 or 20 days, twice daily for 56 days. Minimum of 6 sessions required for inclusion." .

