Manual stimulation was used in auricular point sticking, where patients pressed seeds to induce a swelling feeling.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Bumei (Insomnia)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Insomnia" ;
