    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measure: Efficacy rate (number ofPatients cured, improvedSignificantly, and improved)
Secondary outcome measure: NotSpecified""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each acupuncture session: Needles retained for 25 minutes
Frequency of sessions: Once every day or every other day
Overall treatment duration: 2 courses, each course lasting 7 days""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Auricular point sticking: twice in one week; Acupuncture: once every day or every other day, with needles retained for 25 minutes each time." .

