tara-kb:S-112625-1490 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1490" ;
    dc:title "Tranquilizing Mind Acupuncture in the Treatment of 35 Patients with Insomnia" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Primary acupoints: Baihui (DU20), Neiguan (PC6), Shenmen (HT7)
Additional acupoints based on TCM diagnosis:
Liver fire: Taichong (LR3), Xingjian (LR2), Fengchi (GB20)
Phlegm heat: Taichong (LR3), Fenglong (ST40)
Estrangement of Stomach Qi: Zusanli (ST36), Zhongwan (RN12), Tianshu (ST25)
Blood stasis: Ganshu (BL18), Geshu (BLI7), Xuehai (SP10)
Deficiency of heart and spleen: Xinshu (BL15), Pishu (BL20), Sanyinjiao (SP6)
Qi deficiency heart and gallbladder: Xinshu (BLI5), Danshu (BL19)
Disharmony of heart and kidney: Taixi (K13), Xinshu (BL15), Shenshu (BL23)
Operation methods:
Baihui (DU20): horizontally punctured 0.5~0.8 cun towards the back
Sishencong (EX HN1): punctured towards the direction of Baihui (DU20) for 0.50 .8 cun
Neiguan (PC6) and Shenmen (HT7): perpendicularly punctured for 0.5~1 cun""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group consisted of 35 patients who were administered with 2 mg of Estazolam every night before going to bed. The treatment course was the same as for the treatment group." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "China" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "DU 20, PC 6, HT 7, LR 3, LR 2, GB 20, ST 40, ST 36, RN 12, ST 25, BL 18, BL 17, SP 10, BL 15, BL 20, SP 6, BL 19, K 13, BL 23, EX HN 1" ;
