    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (no sham group was used in the study)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "Manual manipulation (lifting and thrusting technique for tonifying), thermal stimulation (thunder fire moxibustion), seeking sensations of soreness, numbness, distending, and heaviness." ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Insomnia in heart spleen deficiency" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Insomnia" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings """"The results showed cure in 8 cases, remarkable effect in 15 cases, effect in 10 cases, failure in 2 cases and the total effective rate in 91.4% in the treatment group, and cure in 4 cases, remarkable effect in 11 cases, effect in 11 cases, failure in 9 cases, and the total effective rate in 74.2% in the control group."
"The difference is statistically significant in comparison of the total effective rates between the two groups (P < 0.05)."
"Thunder fire moxibustion gives a better therapeutic effect in the acupuncture treatment of insomnia in heart spleen deficiency."
"After 1 3 courses of treatments, the total effective rate was 91.4% in the treatment group and 74.2% in the control group, obviously higher in the treatment group than in the control group."
Yes""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measures:
Cure: ClinicalSymptoms disappear,PatientSleeps more than 6 hoursSoundly each night.
Remarkable effect:SymptomsSignificantly relieved.
Effect:Symptoms relieved,Sleeping hours increase by less than 3 hours.
Failure: No obvious improvement,Sleeping time less than 3 hours.
Total effective rate:Percentage ofPatientsShowing cure, remarkable effect, or effect.
Secondary outcome measures: NotSpecified.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "The treatment was administered once every day, with 10 sessions as one course, for 1 3 courses." .

