Observation group: 52
Acupuncture group: 52
Chinese herbal formula group: 52""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (no sham acupuncture group was used in the study)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "Manual manipulation (even manipulation, perpendicular puncture, oblique puncture with reducing manipulation); needles retained for 30 minutes and manipulated 2 3 times; magnetic seeds for auricular point sticking with kneading and pressing to achieve warm sensation and distending pain." ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Insomnia (described as 'sleeplessness' in Chinese medicine)" ;
