    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Major points: Shenting (GV 24), Baihui (GV 20), Dazhui (GV 14), Mingmen (GV 4)
Adjunct points:
For liver qi stagnation: Taichong (LR 3), Ganshu (BL 18)
For deficiency of the heart and spleen: Xinshu (BL 15), Zusanli (ST 36)
For yin deficiency of the liver and kidney: Taixi (KI 3), Ganshu (BL 18)
Method: Puncture with filiform needles of 0.30 mm in diameter and 40 mm in length, retain for 30 min upon arrival of qi, once a day, 5 times per week""" ;
