Auricular acupuncture: Various techniques including needling, semen vaccariae seeds taping, magnetic pearls, and laser irradiation.
Scalp acupuncture: Insertion of needles with or without electro stimulation.
Moxibustion: Burning moxa at acupoints.
Sham acupuncture: Mimics real acupuncture without actual stimulation.
Not specified: Use of electrical stimulation (electroacupuncture) in all studies.""" ;
