    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified (the paper does not explicitly mention a TCM condition or disease)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Acute low back pain (aLBP)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings "Yes" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measure: Improvement in low back pain using the 10-point numerical rating scale (NRS)
Secondary outcome measures:
Disability using the Oswestry Disability Index (ODI)
Patient global impression of change (PGIC)
Lumbar range of motion (ROM)
Straight leg raising (SLR)
Adverse events""" ;
