    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Main points: Baihui (GV 20), Renzhong (GV 26), Lianquan (CV 23), Neiguan (PC 6), Quchi (LI 11), Hegu (LI 4), Xuehai (SP 10), Zusanli (ST 36), Fenglong (ST 40), Sanyinjiao (SP 6), Taichong (LR 3)
