tara-kb:S-112625-1533 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1533" ;
    dc:title """Influence of Electric Scalp Acupuncture
on Blood Apolipoprotein in Patients of Stroke:
A Prospective Randomized Trial on 183 Patients""" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Electric Scalp Acupuncture (ESA): Anterior oblique vertex temporal line, MS, Posterior oblique vertex temporal line; intersections with Du Channel, Para parietal 1, and Para parietal 2.
Conventional Acupuncture (CA): Jianyu (LI 15), Binao (LI 14), Shousanli (LI 10), Hegu (LI 4), Biguan (ST 31), Zusanli (ST 36), Kunlun (BL 60), Waiguan (SJ 5), Yanglingquan (GB 34), Juegu (GB 39); chosen based on "Yangming for all kinds of flaccidities."
Only acupoints on the ipsilateral side were used.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
