    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each acupuncture session: 30 minutes
Needles retained for: 30 minutes""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency """Electric Scalp Acupuncture: Applied daily for 30 minutes for 30 days.
Conventional Acupuncture: Applied once a day for 6 days, followed by a one day rest, repeated for 30 days.""" .

