    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The stimulation used in the study was electroacupuncture, with electric stimulation provided on each acupoint. The intensity was adjusted based on the presence of De Qi, described as soreness, heaviness, and numbness. The frequency of stimulation was 2Hz. De Qi was initially provoked by manual stimulation, but the primary method was electrical stimulation using an electronic acupunctoscope." ;
