    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Upper limb: Jiquan (HT1), Chize (LUS), Daling (PC7) for flexor muscles; Jianyu (LI15), Tianjing (TE10), Yangchi (SJ4) for extensor muscles
Lower limb: Chengfu (BL36), Xuehai (SP10), Zhaohai (KI6) for extensor muscles; Biguan (ST31), Ququan (LR8), Shenmai (BL62) for flexor muscles
Techniques: Reducing method for yin channels, reinforcing method for yang channels
Selection criteria: Points selected on the affected side""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group consisted of 30 cases of spastic hemiparalysis patients. The specific intervention or treatment for this group is not explicitly stated in the paper. The general conditions of the control group were comparable to the other groups, with no significant differences. The evaluation process for the control group was the same as for the other groups, with assessments made by physicians from the Rehabilitation Department." ;
