        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1567" ;
    dc:title "A Randomized Trial Comparing Acupuncture and Simulated Acupuncture for Subacute and Chronic Whiplash" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Real electroacupuncture points: Xuan Zhong (GB 39), Feng Chi (GB 20), Que Chi (LI 14), Yang Lao (S 16) bilaterally.
Simulated electroacupuncture points: 20 to 30 mm away from real points, not on meridians.
Needle depth: 1 to 1.5 cm.
Duration: 30 minutes.
Criteria for choosing points: Not specified.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group used in this study was the simulated electroacupuncture group. This group received a sham intervention where needles were inserted at points not on traditional meridians and the electrical output was inactivated, mimicking the real acupuncture procedure but without actual therapeutic effect." ;
