    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "Needles were stimulated by insertion until achieving a \"de Qi\" sensation, a feeling of soreness, fuliness, heaviness, or local area distension. No additional stimulation methods like manual manipulation, electrical stimulation, thermal, or laser were mentioned." ;
