    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Cherkin et al.: Simulated acupuncture was used, but specific details on the sham procedure are not provided.
Haake et al.: Sham acupuncture was used, but specific details on the sham procedure are not provided.
Brinkhaus et al.: Minimal acupuncture was used as a sham, with superficial penetration at non-acupuncture points without eliciting de-qi.""" ;
