    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Li 2000: Reducing technique was applied for 5 min, and needles were retained for 25 min
Zhou 2004: Even reinforcing reducing technique was applied for 2 min every 10 min, with needles retained for 40 min
Guo 2005: Reducing technique was applied every 10 min for 30 min
Wang 2006: Manual manipulation was used to obtain De qi, with needles retained for 30 60 min
Zheng 2008: Electroacupuncture for 30 min, with deep insertion at ST7
Xu 2008: Reducing technique was applied and repeated twice during the 20 min treatment
Shi 2008: Reducing technique was applied, followed by electroacupuncture for 1 h
Gao 2008: Even reinforcing reducing technique was applied for 1 min Duration of treatment not specified
Jiao 2008: Even reinforcing reducing technique was applied for 2 min every 10 min with needles retained for 40 min
Fu 2008: Manual manipulation every 10 min to create a radiating sensation towards the affected area, with needles retained for 30 min
Zhao 2009: Manual manipulation was used to obtain De qi, followed by electroacupuncture for 1 h
Han 2009: Reducing technique was applied, followed by electroacupuncture for 30 min""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Daily for 10 to 45 days" .

