    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "Manual manipulation was used to stimulate the needles every 5 minutes to maintain the needling sensation in the experimental group. The stimulation aimed to reach a specific depth or sensation (zhen gan or de qi). No stimulation was applied in the sham acupuncture group as it used blunt needles and simulated the feeling of needling without actual penetration." ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified (the paper does not provide a TCM diagnosis or condition for the primary medical condition)" ;
