    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (no sham acupuncture group was used in the study)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Manual acupuncture: Needles inserted to a depth of 1 cm without additional manipulation.
Laser acupuncture: Non-invasive, low-intensity, and non-thermal effect at skin with a wavelength of 660 nm and output power of 50 mW.
Electromagnetic field stimulation: Applied using a solenoid coil with a frequency of 2 Hz and 460 gauss.""" ;
