tara-kb:S-112625-1648 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1648" ;
    dc:title "Clinical Study on Treatment of Post stroke Depression by Scalp Acupuncture plus Body Acupuncture" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Scalp Acupuncture:
Anterior Temporal Line (from Hanyan (GB 4) to Xuanli (GB 6))
Anterior Oblique Line of Vertex temporal (from Qianding (GV 21) to Xuanli (GB 6))
Lower lateral Line of Occiput (2 inches superior and inferior to Yuzhen (BL 9))
Lateral Line 1 of Vertex (from Tongtian (BL 7) to Yuzhen (BL 9))
Body Acupuncture: Baihui (GV 20), Yintang (Ex HN 3), Danzhong (CV 17), Hegu (LI 4), Taichong (LR 3), Quchi (LI 11), Sanyinjiao (SP 6), Fenglong (ST 40), Dazhui (GV 14), Benshen (GB 13).
Selection based on TCM diagnoses:Liver qi stagnation, Liver qi stagnation and retention of phlegm, Deficiency in the heart and spleen, Yang deficiency of the liver and kidney
Needle details:
Filiform needles, 40 50 mm in length; Inserted obliquely into the scalp with twisting until needling sensation
Twisted in body acupuncture until aching and distending sensation appeared. Retained for 30-50 minutes, once a day.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group was treated with oral administration of Fluoxetine." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
