    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """General acupuncture rehabilitation:
Upper limb: Jianyu (LI 15), Quchi (LI 11), Waiguan (TE 5), Hegu (LI 4)
Lower limb: Fengshi (GB 31), Xuehai (SP 10), Zusanli (ST 36), Jiexi (ST 41), Taichong (LR 3)
Electroacupuncture:
Baihui (GV 20): on the vertex, strengthens the brain
Yintang (Ex HN 3): on the forehead, regulates the Governor Vessel and wakes up the brain
Shenmen (HT 7): soothes the heart and calms the mind
Neiguan (PC 6): dilates the chest and relieves depression
Qimen (LR 14): soothes the liver, relieves depression, and regulates emotions""" ;
