    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Main points: Shenshu (BL 23), Zusanli (ST 36), Sanyinjiao (SP 6)
Auxiliary points: Baihui (GV 20), Danzhong (CV 17), Neiguan (PC 6), Shenmen (HT 7), Taichong (LI 3), Ganshu (BL 18), Taixi (KI 3), Dahe (KI 12), Pishu (BL 20), Guanyuan (CV 4)
Selection criteria: Yin deficiency type (Ganshu, Taixi, Dahe), Yang deficiency type (Pishu, Guanyuan)
Needle insertion details: Baihui and Danzhong inserted at 30¬∞ angle, 0.5 cun depth; others inserted perpendicularly with depth according to patient build""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Controlled Trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group consisted of 15 cases who received Oryzanol orally, 10 mg three times a day, for a treatment course of 4 weeks." ;
