Yintang (EX-HN 3): Added to refresh mind and ease mental stress.
Shuigou (GV 26): Added to refresh mind and ease mental stress.
Hegu (LI 4): Selected to pacify liver, regulate qi, relieve mental depression, and remove stagnation.
Taichong (LR 3): Selected to pacify liver, regulate qi, relieve mental depression, and remove stagnation.
Shenmen (HT 7): Yuan-primary point of Heart Meridian, calms mind.
Neiguan (PC 6): Relaxes chest, eases mental stress, and relieves mental depression.""" ;
