tara-kb:S-112625-1663 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-1663" ;
    dc:title "Clinical Observation on Combined Acupuncture and Medicine in Treating Post stroke Depression" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Major points: Niesanzhen (Extra, three points on the bitemporal)
First point: 2 cun above the ear apex
Second point: 1 cun anterior to the first point
Third point: 1 cun posterior to the first point
Adjunct points: Bilateral Neiguan (PC 6), Zusanli (ST 36), Fenglong (ST 40), Taichong (LR 3)
Needling technique:
Niesanzhen (Extra): Needle tip downward, 15¬∞ angle, 0.8 1.2 cun depth
Neiguan (PC 6) and Taichong (LR 3): Perpendicular insertion, 0.5 1 cun depth
Zusanli (ST 36) and Fenglong (ST 40): Perpendicular insertion, 0.8 1.2 cun depth
Electroacupuncture: G6805 A II type device, Sparse dense wave, intensity within patient's tolerance""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group received medication alone, specifically Fluoxetine capsules, without any acupuncture treatment." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "China" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "Niesanzhen, PC 6, ST 36, ST 40, LR 3" ;
