Taixi (KI 3): To tonify kidney yin.
Quchi (LI 11): To regulate meridians and free qi and blood.
Waiguan (TE 5): To regulate meridians and free qi and blood.
Hegu (LI 4): To regulate meridians and free qi and blood.""" ;
