    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol "Needles inserted in a harmonic craniocaudal manner at a depth of about 2 cm.; Extra points on the head and the neck: Yintang, Sishencong; LI4-Hegu; HT7-Shenmen; PC6-Neiguan; TE5-Waguan; CV12 or REN MAI-Zhongwan; CV6 or REN MAI-Qihai; CV4 or REN MAI-Guanyan; ST36-Zusanli; SP6-Sanyinjiao; SP9-Yinlinquan; GB34-Yanglngquan; LR3-Taichong; LU7-Liegue; LR5-Ligou; KI3-Taixi; KI6-Zhohai; Scalp areas: A-control area of blood vessels; B-vertigo area; C-frontal area; D-prefrontal area. Points chosen based on traditional Chinese medicine diagnosis, specifically addressing kidney deficiency and other related diagnoses.; Points were used bilaterally." ;
