Dermal Needle Therapy: Stomach Meridian of Foot-Yangming, Spleen Meridian of Foot-Taiyin, Bladder Meridian of Foot-Taiyang, Kidney Meridian of Foot-Shaoyin""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT), Quasi-Randomized Trial" ;
