Zhou 2002: Western medications and self massage of legs (dipyridamole 50mg three times a day + nicotinic acid 50mg three times a day + inositol 1g before bedtime + self massage of legs before bedtime)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "China" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
