    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """HT7: At the ulnar end of the transverse crease of the wrist
HT8: Between the fourth and fifth metacarpal bones
LI4: On the dorsum of the hand, between the first and second metacarpal bones
ST36: On the lateral side of the shank, one finger breadth from the anterior crest of the tibia
PC6: 2 cun above the transverse crease of the wrist, between the tendon of musculus palmaris longus and musculus flexor radialis
SP6: 3 cun above the medial malleolus, dorsal to the posterior border of the tibia
CV4: On the midline 3 cun below the umbilicus""" ;
