Quantity: One sham needle per point
Size: Not specified
Location: Same points as standard point acupuncture
Penetration: Non-penetrating
Other details: Blunted needle tip, creates pricking sensation without penetration""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The needles were inserted and left in place for 20 minutes. The practitioners elicited de qi sensations from each patient following needle insertion. No additional stimulation methods such as manual manipulation, electrical stimulation, thermal stimulation, or laser were mentioned." ;
