Frequency of sessions: Twice per week
Duration of each session: Approximately 30 minutes
Needles left in place: 20 minutes""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "twice weekly for 6 weeks, with each session lasting about 30 minutes and needles left in place for 20 minutes" .

