    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Sham procedure: Placebo acupuncture with needles inserted at points close to real acupuncture points but verified to have no electrical activity.
Needle type: Same type as real acupuncture needles.
Quantity: Twelve needles used per treatment.
Size: 0.30 x 30mm.
Location: Away from classical acupuncture points and meridians, 2 to 4cm away from real points.
Penetrating: Yes, needles were inserted into the skin.
Duration: Needles retained for 30 minutes.""" ;
