    tara-kb:hasMappedWesternCondition MONDO:0005244 ;
    tara-kb:hasNeedlingDetails """Acupuncture group: Depth of insertion varied by acupoint: LI4 (1.20-1.53 cm), ST40 (1.82-2.25 cm), LI11 (1.38-1.50 cm), ST36 (2.11-2.30 cm), SP6 (1.73-2.00 cm)
