tara-kb:S-112625-177 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-177" ;
    dc:title "A randomized controlled trial of acupuncture in stable ischemic heart disease patients" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """PC 6: 2 cun above the transverse crease of the wrist, between the tendons of m. palmaris longus and m. flexor carpi radialis. Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-0.8 in., even method.
PC 4: 5 cun above the transverse crease of the wrist, between the tendons of m. palmaris longus and m. flexor carpi radialis. Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-1 in., even method.
HT 7: At the ulnar end of the transverse crease of the wrist, in the depression on the radial side of the tendon of m. flexor carpi ulnaris. Puncture perpendicularly 0.3-0.5 in., even method.
Ren 17: On the anterior midline, at the level with the fourth intercostal space, midway between the nipples. Puncture subcutaneously 0.3-0.5 in., even method.
LI 4: On the dorsum of the hand, between the 1st and 2nd metacarpal bones, approximately in the middle of the 2nd metacarpal bone on the radial side. Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-1 in., reducing method.
LIV 3: On the dorsum of the foot, in the depression distal to the junction of the first and second metatarsal bones. Puncture perpendicularly 0.3-0.5 in., reducing method.
ST 36: 3 cun below St35, in the depression lateral to the patellar ligament, one index finger-breadth from the anterior crest of the tibia, in m. tibialis anterior. Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-1.2 in., reinforcing method.
SP 6: 3 cun directly above the tip of the medial malleolus, on the posterior border of the medial aspect of the tibia. Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-1 in., reinforcing method.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Traditional Acupuncture (TA): Received needle insertion at acupuncture sites.
Sham Acupuncture (SA): Received a sham at non-acupuncture sites near TA acupoints but no needle was inserted.
Waiting Control (WC): Received nothing.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "United States" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "http://dx. doi.org/10.1016/j.ijcard.2014.07.011" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "PC 6, PC 4, HT 7, Ren 17, LI 4, LIV 3, ST 36, SP 6" ;
