    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measure: Salivary cortisol concentrations (specifically, the cortisol awakening response)
Secondary outcome measure: Perceived Stress Scale 14 (PSS-14) for self-reported stress levels""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each acupuncture session: 30 minutes
Duration needles were left in place: Not specified beyond 30 minutes of electrical stimulation""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Five sessions per week for four weeks, with each session lasting 30 minutes. Total of 20 sessions." .

