    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Sham Streitberger's needle: Uses a 0.25 √ó 40 mm sterilized stainless steel needle, mimics real acupuncture appearance and procedure, non-penetrating.
Park Sham device with sham needle: Uses a 0.25 √ó 40 mm sterilized stainless steel needle, maintains same appearance and procedure as real acupuncture, non-penetrating.
Phantom acupuncture: Non-penetrating, no tactile stimulation, uses video clip to simulate experience.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "Manual stimulation: During 3 min of phasic session, manual stimulation was conducted eight times based on an audio signal received via a headphone. Interval between each manual stimulation was from 10 to 14 s. For each manual stimulation, the acupuncture needle was rotated five times during 3 s. The response sought was de-qi." ;
