    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group in this study is the MOR (oral morphine sulphate) group, which serves as a comparison to the WAA (Wrist-Ankle Acupuncture) intervention group. No sham-acupuncture control was used due to ethical considerations." ;
