    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """For kidney yang deficiency: Shenshu (BL 23), Mingmen (GV 4), Sanyinjiao (SP 6), Guanyuan (CV 4)
For heart spleen deficiency: Xinshu (BL 15), Zhongji (CV 3), Zusanli (ST 36), Pishu (BL 20), Jueyinshu (BL 14)
For damp heat in the lower jiao: Shangliao (BL 31), Ciliao (BL 32), Zhongliao (BL 33), Xialiao (BL 34), Rangu (KI 2), Yinlingquan (SP 9), Sanyinjiao (SP 6), Tianshu (ST 25), Taixi (KI 3)
Needle insertion depth: 1 2 cun
Needle type: Filiform needles of 0.35 mm in diameter and 75 mm in length
Additional techniques: Low frequency electroacupuncture, infrared ray irradiation""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group consisted of 50 cases of impotence patients who were treated with acupuncture alone, without any herbal medication. The treatment was conducted once a day for 30 minutes, with infrared ray irradiation, and consisted of 10 treatments per course." ;
