    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Active treatment: Needling points chosen according to the Chinese type of hypertension, with angle, depth, and type of manipulation conforming to typical prescriptions. Specific points not explicitly listed.
Sham treatment: Pl1 (dorsolateral forearm between SI 7 and 8 on the small intestine meridian), Pl2 (lateral thigh between Gb 32 and 31 on the gallbladder meridian), Pl3 (lateral lower limb between Gb 34 and 35 on the gallbladder meridian).""" ;
