Active treatment group: 72
Sham treatment group: 68""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Sham treatment was identical in number, distribution, and duration to active treatment.
Needling points were chosen without relevance for blood pressure lowering according to traditional Chinese medicine.
Sham points were located on the dorsolateral forearm, lateral thigh, and lateral lower limb.
Same technique as active treatment was used, with real needles (25-to 50-mm-long, 0.25-mm-diameter).
Sham treatment was penetrating and performed bilaterally.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "Manual manipulation; Not specified if any type of sensation was sought. No electrical, thermal, or laser stimulation mentioned." ;
