    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (no sham acupuncture group was used in the study)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The stimulation involved electroacupuncture (EA) with different frequencies (100 Hz and 2 Hz), with the current strength increasing from 0.5 mA to 1 mA to 2 mA over 30 minutes. Local stimulation was also applied by needling with a purging maneuver." ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified (the paper does not explicitly mention the TCM terms for the conditions being studied)" ;
