    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Group A: Guanyuan (CV 4) and Sanyinjiao (SP 6)
Group B: Neiguan (PC 6) and Zusanli (ST 36)
Specific locations and depths for needle insertion:
Guanyuan (CV 4): Improved Qi Ci (triple needling) method, depth of 1.5 2.0 cun
Sanyinjiao (SP 6): Punctured perpendicularly to a depth of 0.8 1.2 cun
Neiguan (PC 6): Inserted perpendicularly to a depth of 0.5 cun
Zusanli (ST 36): Inserted to a depth of 1.0 1.5 cun""" ;
