Sunay et al (2011): Twice 20-min sessions per week
Venzke et al (2010): Twice weekly 25 min in the first 4 wk and once a week in the remaining 8 wk
Vincent et al (2007): Biweekly 30-min sessions
Wyon et al (2004): Twice weekly 30 min in the first 2 wk and once a week in the remaining 10 wk""" .

