tara-kb:S-112625-201 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-201" ;
    dc:title "Acupuncture for the sequelae of Bell's palsy: a randomized controlled trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """ST4 (unaffected side): Dispel wind and relieve pain indirectly in affected buccal side; transversely toward ST6; mild reinforcing-reducing method; depth: 20-30 mm
ST6 (unaffected side): Dispel wind and relieve pain indirectly in affected buccal side; transversely toward ST4; mild reinforcing-reducing method; depth: 20-30 mm
ST1 (affected side): Facilitate movement in affected infra-orbital lesion; transversely toward the eye; mild reinforcing-reducing method; depth: 5-10 mm
EX-HN4 (affected side): Facilitate movement in affected supra-orbital lesion; transversely toward the eye; mild reinforcing-reducing method; depth: 5-10 mm
TE23 (affected side): Facilitate movement in affected supra-orbital lesion; transversely toward the ear; mild reinforcing-reducing method; depth: 20-30 mm
LI20 (affected side): Facilitate movement in affected nasolabial lesion; obliquely along the nasolabial sulcus toward the root of the nose; mild reinforcing-reducing method; depth: 20-30 mm
TE17 (both sides): Benefit head or face and ears; perpendicular to skin; mild reinforcing-reducing method; depth: 20-30 mm
ST9 (both sides): Regulate Qi and blood of whole body; perpendicular to skin; mild reinforcing-reducing method; depth: 20-30 mm
LI10 (both sides): Regulate Qi and blood of whole body; perpendicular to skin; reinforcing method; depth: 20-30 mm
LI4 (both sides): Regulate face and head area, tone Qi; perpendicular to skin; reinforcing method; depth: 20-30 mm
ST36 (both sides): Tone Qi and blood of whole body; perpendicular to skin; reinforcing method; depth: 20-30 mm
GB34 (both sides): Treat soft tissue anywhere in body; treat contractions, cramp, pain, spasm, weakness, numbness, paralysis; perpendicular to skin; reinforcing method; depth: 20-30 mm""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group used in this study was a no-acupuncture waiting list group. This group did not receive acupuncture treatments during the 8-week period after randomization but were informed they would receive identical acupuncture treatment after the study period." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Korea" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "ST 4, ST 6, ST 1, EX-HN 4, TE 23, LI 20, TE 17, ST 9, LI 10, LI 4, ST 36, GB 34" ;
