    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "Not specified (the paper does not provide specific details on the duration of each acupuncture session or the retention time of the needles)" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "The frequency of treatment varied from 1 to 70 sessions. In Chinese studies, a common frequency was about 30 sessions or 1 month of treatment. Specific frequencies included: 2 times/w*3, 14 times, 7 times/w*10, and 30 times. No unified frequency was used across all studies." .

