    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Verum Acupuncture Group: GV23; bilateral BL2, GB14, TE23, Ex1, ST1, GB20; unilateral SP3, LU9, LU10, HT8 (on the left for men, right for women)
Sham Acupuncture Group: Points 2 cm lateral to ST4, 2 cm below ST7, at the parietal eminence of the head, 2 cm internal to ST9, 10 cm internal to BL57, 1.5 cm internal to ST36, single points at the left middle point of the biceps brachii muscle belly, points at 2, 4 and 6 cm from the left wrist fold, one point located between the left 3rd and 4th metatarsophalangeal joints""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "Sham acupuncture group: Seventeen sham points of shallow penetration without other manipulation were used as a control. The sham points were as follows: both points 2 cm lateral to ST4, 2 cm below ST7, at the parietal eminence of the head, 2 cm internal to ST9, 10 cm internal to BL57, 1.5 cm internal to ST36, single points at the left middle point of the biceps brachii muscle belly, points at 2, 4 and 6 cm from the left wrist fold and one point located between the left 3rd and 4th metatarsophalangeal joints." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Korea" ;
