Group 1 (spectacles alone): 42
Group 2 (spectacles + acupuncture): 41""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (no sham acupuncture group was used in the study)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The needles were stimulated through manual manipulation by rotation methods to achieve \"de qi,\" a unique sensation important for the efficacy of acupuncture. The needles were left in place for 15 minutes and revisited for further manipulation as appropriate." ;
