    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency """Frequency of Treatment: 28 sessions over 8 weeks
Initial Frequency: 5 sessions per week for the first 2 weeks
Subsequent Frequency: 3 sessions per week for the remaining 6 weeks
Duration of Each Session: 30 minutes""" .

