Other points mentioned in tables:
CV6, CV10, CV13, EX-HN3, DU24, DU20 (Xu et al. 2015)
ST42, ST40, ST36, ST34 (Yang 2009; Zhang 2009; Wang et al. 2015)
CV12; ST25, PC6, ST36 (Hu 2012)
ST36, KI3 (Jin 2011)
ST36, PC6 (Li 2014; Wang et al. 2012)
LI4, LR3, ST36, PC6, SP4, CV12 (Park et al. 2009)
SP6, SP9, SJ6 (Shiu et al. 2014)
ST36, ST44, LR3, PC6, BL20, BL21, BL18, CV12 (Tang et al. 2006)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Sham acupuncture was used as a control in six trials.
Medication (prokinetic agents: Itopride, Mosapride, and Domperidone) was used as a control in nine trials.
One trial used both sham acupuncture and medication as separate control groups.""" ;
