    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "Not specified (the paper does not provide the duration of each acupuncture session or how long the needles were left in place)" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency """Acupuncture: Bilateral injections of vitamin B1 at the tsusanli acupoint, once daily for 6 consecutive days or until flatus.
SMD Decoction: 10 mL/dose, three times per day, starting on the first day after hepatectomy.
Chewing Gum: Three times daily for 30 minutes each time, for 6 consecutive days or until flatus.""" .

