Additional primary outcome measures: Improvements in clinical symptoms, frequency of defecation, straining, lumpy or hard stools, sensation of incomplete evacuation, sensation of anorectal obstruction= blockage, manual techniques to facilitate defecation
Secondary outcome measures: Cost and number of standard treatment interventions, percentage of compliant days""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency """Trial comparing acupuncture with conventional medicine: 5 days/wk, 2 wks
