    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "Electroacupuncture using an ACUS II stimulator with stainless steel needles introduced intramuscularly to a depth of 5-15 mm. Stimulation involved square pulses with alternating polarity (frequency 2 Hz, duration 180 ms, intensity 2.5 mA) at specific acupuncture points. The stimulation aimed to induce Dechi, a sensation of local pain, heat, numbness, or soreness." ;
