Needle retention time: 20 minutes""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency """Frequency: Twice a week (by an expert)
Number of sessions: 10 sessions
Duration of each session: 25 minutes
Duration of treatment period: 4 weeks
Initial frequency (first 2 weeks): Three times a week
Final frequency (last 2 weeks): Twice a week""" .

