    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-272" ;
    dc:title "Is acupuncture in addition to conventional medicine effective as pain treatment for endometriosis? A randomised controlled cross-over trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Verum Group: Bl 32 -ciliao (second sacral foramen), St 29 -guidai (4 cun below the navel and 2 cun lateral), St 36 -zusanli (lower leg, 3 cun below the lateral eye of the knee), Ren 3 -zhongji (midline, 1 cun superior to the symphysis), Sp 6 -sanyinjiao (at the posterior margin of the tibia, 3 cun directly above the medial malleolus of the ankle), Li 3 -taichong (on the foot, 2 cun above the web between first and second toe), Li 8ququan (with knee flexed, at the end of the medial end of the popliteal crease), Sp 9 -yinlingquan (with knee flexed, at the inferior margin of the medial tibial condyle), Sp 10 -xuehai (2 cun above the superior medial border of the kneecap), Ki 10 -yingu (between semitendinosus and semimembranosus muscle at the knee).
Control Group: SI 9 -jianzhen (1 cun above the posterior axillary crease), Gb 31 -fengshi (1 cun superior to the popliteal crease where the middle finger reaches when placed on the thigh), Lu 1 -zhongfu (on the chest, 6 cun from the midline at the level of the first intercostal space, 1 cun below the lateral extremity of the clavicle), St 8 -touwei (4 cun lateral to the median line of the head at the hairline).
Points were chosen based on TCM criteria and individual conditions for the verum group.
All points except Ren meridian were used bilaterally.
Insertion depth varied from intracutaneous to intramuscular according to TCM diagnosis.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT) with a cross-over design" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Group 2 initially received non-specific acupuncture (defined acupuncture points with no correlation to endometriosis) as the control group.
The study used a cross-over design, where both groups served as control and intervention groups at different stages.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Austria" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "BL 32, ST 29, ST 36, REN 3, SP 6, LI 3, LI 8, SP 9, SP 10, KI 10, SI 9, GB 31, LU 1, ST 8" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupointsMapped TARA:0022762,
