    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Needles were stimulated both manually and electrically.
Manual stimulation was used to achieve "de qi" once when inserted.
Electrical stimulation was applied at 2 Hz for 30 minutes to specific points (CV 3, CV 6, ST 29, SP 6, and SP 9) to produce local muscle contractions without pain or discomfort.
Manual rotation of needles at LI 4/PC 6 was used to evoke needle sensation every 10 minutes.""" ;
