    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measure: Changes in serum T between low-frequency EA and physical exercise at week 16.
Secondary outcome measures: Changes in serum T between low-frequency EA and physical exercise at week 32; changes in menstrual frequency, acne and hirsutism, FT, DHT, E1, E1-S, E2, DHEA, DHEAS, 4-DIONE, 5-DIOL, ADT-G, 3G, 17G, SHBG, LH, FSH, LH/FSH ratio, BMI, and V ÀôO2max at weeks 16 and 32 between the two intervention groups and between each intervention group and the no active intervention group.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each acupuncture session: 30 minutes for electrical stimulation
Duration needles were left in place: Not specified""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency """Frequency: Twice weekly for 2 weeks, once weekly for 6 weeks, once every other week for 8 weeks.
Total treatments: 14 over 16 weeks.
Mean treatments received: 12.5.""" .

