    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "Not specified (the paper does not provide information on the duration of each acupuncture session or how long the needles were left in place)" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Patients received a total of 16 sessions of acupuncture treatment. The treatment schedule was as follows: five sessions in the first and second weeks, with acupuncture administered once a day; three sessions in the third and fourth weeks, with acupuncture administered every other day." .

