    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measures: number of hot flushes in 24 hours, distress from hot flushes in 24 hours, change in "hot flush score"
Secondary outcome measure: change in 24-h urine excretion of CGRP (calcitonin gene-related peptide)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each acupuncture session: 30 minutes
Frequency of sessions: Twice a week for the first two weeks, then once a week for ten weeks
Depth of needle insertion: 5-20 mm
Duration needles were left in place: Not specified""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Treatment was given by a physiotherapist for 30 min twice a week during the first 2 wk, and then once a week during 10 wk, with the patients lying on the side. The total treatment period was 12 weeks." .

