tara-kb:S-112625-302 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-302" ;
    dc:title "Electroacupuncture analgesia is associated with increased serum brain-derived neurotrophic factor in chronic tension-type headache: a randomized, sham controlled, crossover trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Medial aspect of splenius capitis and semispinalis capitis muscles at the level of C1-C2 vertebrae
Lateral aspect of trapezius
Semispinalis capitis muscle at the level of C6-T1 vertebrae
Levator scapulae muscles at the level of C6-T1
Abductor pollicis brevis and dorsal interossei muscles in the hand
Ear: superior and central area of the tip of the triangular fossa, between the junction of the superior crus and the inferior crus of the antihelix; helix root, an area of innervation by the vagus nerve""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "Sham intervention: An electroacupuncture device was used with no current passing through the electrodes, and no needling was performed. The electrodes were placed in the same areas as the real stimulation, but no actual stimulation was delivered." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Brazil" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "Not specified" ;
