Total participants completed: 29
Participants in EA first group: 17
Participants in Sham first group: 17""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Sham procedure: Non-penetrating
Needle type: No needling used
Quantity and size: Not applicable
Location: Electrodes placed in the same areas as real stimulation
Other details: Electroacupuncture device adjusted to prevent current from passing through electrodes; patients informed about the sham nature""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The stimulation used was electrical stimulation (electroacupuncture) with an alternating frequency of 2 Hz and 10 Hz for 30 minutes. The intensity was adjusted to produce a gentle tapping sensation or up to the patient's tolerance. Needles on the hand and ear were not electrically stimulated." ;
