tara-kb:S-112625-332 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-332" ;
    dc:title "Efficacy of acupuncture for migraine prophylaxis: A single-blinded, double-dummy, randomized controlled trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Obligatory points: DU20 (Baihui), DU24 (Shenting), GB13 (Benshen), GB8 (Shuaigu), GB20 (Fengchi)
Additional points based on syndromes:
Shaoyang headache: SJ5 (Waiguan), GB34 (Yanglingquan)
Yangming headache: LI4 (Hegu), ST44 (Neiting)
Taiyang headache: BL60 (Kunlun), SI3 (Houxi)
Jueyin headache: LR3 (Taichong), GB40 (Qiuxu)
Nausea and vomiting: PC6 (Neiguan)
Dysphoria and susceptibility to rage: LR3 (Taichong)
Technique: DU20, DU24, GB13, GB8 punctured horizontally; others punctured perpendicularly with lifting, thrusting, and twirling for DeQi
Sham points: Located near elbow and knee joints, 3 mm apart from selected points""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group was treated with sham acupuncture plus flunarizine. Sham acupuncture involved selecting points unrelated to headache treatment near the elbow and knee joints, and flunarizine was administered once per night (10 mg in the first 2 weeks and 5 mg in the next 2 weeks)." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "China" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "DU 20, DU 24, GB 13, GB 8, GB 20, SJ 5, GB 34, LI 4, ST 44, BL 60, SI 3, LR 3, GB 40, PC 6" ;
