    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The stimulation involved light needling with a thin, sterile disposable needle at the Yintang (EX-HN3) point. The needles were kept in place for 30 minutes. No additional stimulation methods were mentioned. The stimulation was intended to induce sedative effects rather than any specific sensation." ;
