Secondary outcome measures:
General Health Questionnaire (GHQ) scores
Short-Form 36 quality of life questionnaire items (impact on social activities and work)
Global assessment of change
Number of tablets used
Headache severity and duration""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "Not specified (the paper does not provide the duration of each acupuncture session or how long the needles were left in place)" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "The treatment was administered weekly for 6 weeks, with two follow-up treatments after 1 and 2 months." .

