    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Siguan acupoint: Combination of bilateral LI4 (Hegu) and Liv3 (Taichong)
LI4 (Hegu): On the dorsum of the left and right hands, at the midpoint on the radial side of the second metacarpal
Liv3 (Taichong): On the dorsum of the left and right feet, in the depression anterior to the junction of the first and second metatarsals
Sham acupoints: Located approximately 10 mm away from Liv3 and LI4""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Controlled Trial" ;
