Other details: Guide tube adhered to skin, sham needle inserted into guide tube without penetrating skin.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The needles were inserted without extra rotational or manual stimulation, and the depth of needle penetration was determined by the patient's sensitivity until a feeling of chi was obtained. No other forms of stimulation were mentioned." ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings "Yes" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measures:Psychological variables (depression, anxiety, andStress) assessed bySelf assessment inventories; Mitogen induced T cellProliferation.
Secondary outcome measure: CellularSensitivity to dexamethasone.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each acupuncture session: 20 minutes
Duration needles were left in place: Not specified""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Three sessions per week, 20 minutes per session, for a total of 10 sessions." .

