Needle size: 0.3 mm in diameter and 5 cm in length, or 1.0 mm in diameter and 10 cm in length.
Location: Non acupuncture points, at least 5 cm away from classic points and meridians.
Penetration: Penetrating.
Frequency: Twice a week.""" ;
