    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Manual acupuncture: Needles stimulated intermittently and irregularly by hand for 30 minutes.
Electro-acupuncture: Needles attached to an electrical stimulator with 2-Hz pulses of 0.5 millisecond duration for 30 minutes, causing non-painful muscle contractions.
