Deficiency of the liver and kidney: Mingmen (GV 4), Guanyuan (CV 4), Shenshu (BL 23), Dahe (KI 12), Zusanli (ST 36)
Main acupoints for control group: Zhongji (CV 6), Diji (SP 8), Sanyinjiao (SP 6)
