tara-kb:S-112625-452 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-452" ;
    dc:title "Acupuncture combined with an antidepressant for patients with depression in hospital: a pragmatic randomised controlled trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Key points: GV24 (Shenting), GV20 (Baihui), GV14 (Dazhui), GV4 (Mingmen)
Additional points based on TCM patterns:
Liver depression and Spleen deficiency: LR3 (Taichong), SP9 (Yinlingquan)
Liver Qi stagnation: LR3, LR14 (Qimen)
Heart and Spleen deficiency: HT7 (Shenmen), ST36 (Zusanli)
Liver and Kidney Yin deficiency: KI3 (Taixi), LR3
Spleen and Kidney Yang deficiency: CV4, CV6
Extra points based on symptoms:
Insomnia and forgetfulness: HT7, An'mian (Ext)
Palpitations and chest tightness: PC6 (Neiguan)
Constipation: ST25 (Tianshu), ST37 (Shangjuxu)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Pragmatic Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group consisted of 26 patients who received selective serotonin reuptake inhibitors (SSRIs) only." ;
