tara-kb:S-112625-454 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-454" ;
    dc:title "The Brain Resuscitation Acupuncture Method for Treatment of Post Wind Stroke Mental Depression" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Main points: Neiguan (PC 6), Renzhong (GV 26), Sanyinjiao (SP 6), Baihui (GV 20), Shenmen (HT 7)
Adjunct points: Jiquan (HT 1), Chize (LU 5), Weizhong (BL 40)
Needling techniques:
Neiguan (PC 6): Perpendicular puncture 0.5 1.0 cun deep, twirling and lifting thrusting manipulation with reducing method.
Renzhong (GV 26): Oblique needling toward nasal septum 0.3 0.5 cun deep, bird pecking manipulation.
Sanyinjiao (SP 6): Oblique needling along medial border of tibia 1.0 1.5 cun deep, lifting thrusting manipulation with reinforcing method.
Baihui (GV 20): Transverse puncture 0.5 1.0 cun, uniform reinforcing reducing manipulation.
Shenmen (HT 7): Transverse upward needling to Lingdao (HT 4) 1.0 1.5 cun, inducing soreness and distending sensation.
Jiquan (HT 1): Insertion one cun below original point, perpendicular needling 1.0 1.5 cun, lifting thrusting manipulation with reducing method.
Chize (LU 5): Perpendicular needling 1.0 cun deep, lifting thrusting manipulation with reducing method.
Weizhong (BL 40): Perpendicular needling 0.5 1.0 cun deep, lifting thrusting manipulation with reducing method.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group received oral medication of Fluoxetine, 20mg/qd, for 4 weeks." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Not specified (the paper does not explicitly mention the country where the study was conducted)" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "Neiguan, Renzhong, Sanyinjiao, Baihui, Shenmen, Jiquan, Weizhong, Chize" ;
