    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified (the paper does not explicitly state a TCM term for the condition)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Post stroke mental depression" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings """The total effective rate showed no significant difference between the treatment and control groups (P>0.05).
The average effect starting time was significantly shorter in the treatment group compared to the control group (P<0.05).
The acupuncture intervention was effective compared to the control group in terms of quicker therapeutic effect: Yes.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measure: Therapeutic effects as measured by changes in HAMDScores
Secondary outcome measures: Total effective rate, average effectStarting time, adverse reactions""" ;
