Siguan points: perpendicularly inserted to a depth of 0.5 cun
Baihui (GV 20): obliquely with 30¬∞ to the scalp to a depth of 0.5 cun
Yintang (EX-HN 3): subcutaneously to a depth of 0.5 cun
Non-acupoint needling: applied to points 0.5 cm lateral to the body points of the Acupuncture group""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Prozac group (P.): Patients received oral administration of Prozac.
