    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Active intervention: Electroacupuncture with electrical stimulation using an Electro-Stimulator 4-C, current of 3-5 mA, frequency of 2 Hz, aiming for a slight but not uncomfortable twitching sensation.
Control intervention: Sham electrostimulation with no current applied to the needles.""" ;
