Both auricular and body acupoints: used in four studies
Selection based on traditional acupuncture theory""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control groups in the meta-analysis received either a placebo (sham acupuncture) or no treatment (nontreatment) for anxiety. Sham acupuncture involved superficial insertion or unrelated acupoints, while nontreatment meant no intervention was provided." ;
