Improvement in Beck's Depression Inventory scores
Reduction in systolic/diastolic blood pressures
Improvement in coefficient of variation of the ReR interval (CVRR)
Secondary outcome measures:
Correlations between changes in BDI-II scores, blood pressure (SBP and DBP), and vagal nerve function indices (CVRR and CVI)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of treatment: 72 hours (3 days) continuously
Duration retained: Needles were left in place for 72 hours (3 days)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "The participants received press needle (PN) acupuncture for 72 hours continuously, which is equivalent to 3 days. The treatment involved stimulating 8 acupoints continuously for these 3 days." .

