    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Sham acupoints were located 2.0-3.0 cm lateral to real points.
Short acupuncture needles (0.22 mm diameter, 13 mm length for neck/shoulder, 40 mm for arm) were used.
Needles were inserted superficially in neck/shoulder, sufficient depth in arm for electrical connection.
Weak electrical stimulation was applied at a frequency of about once per minute.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Manual twisting of the needle was applied on all points to achieve a deqi sensation.
