tara-kb:S-112625-506 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-506" ;
    dc:title "Influence of Electroacupuncture on the Side Effects of Fkuoxetine on Depression Patients" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Primary points: Baihui (GV 20), Shenting (GV 24), Yintang (EX-HN3)
Additional points based on TCM diagnosis:
Liver-qi stagnation: Taichong (LR 3), Qimen (LR 14)
Liver-qi stagnation with phlegm obstruction: Fenglong (ST 40)
Liver-qi turning into fire: Xingjian (LR 2)
Liver-qi stagnation with spleen deficiency: Zusanli (ST 36), Taibai (SP 3)
Liver-yin and kidney-yin deficiency: Taixi (KI 3), Ganshu (BL 18)
Points for specific symptoms:
Insomnia and forgetfulness: Dazhui (GV 14), Sanyinjiao (SP 6)
Palpitation and chest distress: Neiguan (PC 6), Jiuwei (CV 15)
Dry mouth and constipation: Tianshu (ST 25), Shangjuxu (ST 37)
All points were selected bilaterally.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group consisted of 20 cases treated with fluoxetine alone, with oral administration of 20 mg daily." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "China" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
