tara-kb:S-112625-51 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-51" ;
    dc:title "Comparison the effect of lateral wedge insole and acupuncture in medial compartment knee osteoarthritis: A randomized controlled trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """1. EX.31 (Heding): above the knee in the depression of the midpoint of the superior patellar border
2. EX.32 (xiyan): below the patella in the hollow at medial side of the patellar tendon
3. ST.35 (Dubi): lower border of the patella in the depression lateral to the patellar ligament
4. ST.36 (Zusanli): 3 cun below the knee, about one fingerbreadth from the tibial tuberosity
5. ST.44 (Neiting): on the dorsum of the foot, proximal to the web margin between the second and third toes
6. GB.34 (Yanglingquan): in the lateral side of the leg in the hallow anterior and below the capitulum of the fibula, 2 cun below the knee
7. DU.20 (Baihui): at the intersection of the median line at the vertex of the head with a line drawn from the tip of one ear to the other
8. BL.60 (Kunlun): in the depression between the apex of the lateral malleolus and Achilles tendon""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "Not applicable (the study compares two intervention groups without a control group)" ;
