"The statistical differences between the two groups were respectively P<0.05 and P<0.01."
"The therapeutic effects were evaluated at the end of the 4th therapeutic course. As shown in the table, the cured plus markedly effective rate was 83.3% in the treatment group, and that in the control group was 52.8%, with a statistically significant difference (P<0.01)."
"And the statistical analysis also demonstrated that the total effective rate of 97.2% in the treatment group was better than the rate of 83.3% in the control group (P<0.05)."
Yes""" ;
