tara-kb:S-112625-521 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-521" ;
    dc:title "Does acupuncture activate endogenous analgesia in chronic whiplash-associated disorders? A randomized crossover trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Dazhui GV14: Midline of spine between C7 and T1
Huatuojiaji C1-C7: Lateral to midline of spine C1 to C7
Fengchi GB20: In depression between upper ends of sternocleidomastoid and trapezius muscle
Tianzong SI11: In the middle of the fossa infraspinatus
Jianjing GB21: Midway between C7 and the acromion
Tianlioa TE15: At the medial end of the supraclavicular fossa
Jianwaishu SI14: Lateral to the lower border of T1 (medial border of the scapula)
Geshu BL17: Lateral to the lower border of T7
Xuehai SP10: Superior to upper margin of patella, in the vastus medialis muscle
Houxi SI3: On the ulnar side of wrist, between fifth metacarpal bone and carpal bone
Jinggu BL64: Inferior to the tuberosity of fifth metatarsal bone
Waiguan TE5: Proximal to dorsal wrist crease between ulna and radius
Zulinqi GB41: In depression between fourth and fifth metatarsal bones
Shiqizhuixia: Low border of L5
Ear Zero point: Situated at the junction of the conchal ridge and the root of the ascending helix
Ear Jerome point: On the line in the postantitragal fossa, at the intersection with the scapha at the transition to the lobule
Ear C0 point: Caudal area of the antihelix, against the antitragus""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Crossover Pilot Trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "Relaxation therapy using guided imagery as a non-needling control intervention." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Belgium" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
