    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Standard Acupuncture (SA) Group: GB 20, GB 21, BL 10, BL 11, S 12, S 13, TE 5, LI 4, SI 3
Trigger Point (TrP) Group: Trigger points in muscles such as M. Splenius capitis, M. Trapezius, M. Sternoclidom, M. Scalenus, M. Levator scapulae, Paravert M., M. Suboccipitales
Non-Trigger Point (non-TrP) Group: Non-tender points in the same muscles as TrP group but 50 mm away from trigger points
Sham (SH) Group: Same locations as TrP group but with non-penetrating needles""" ;
