tara-kb:S-112625-535 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-535" ;
    dc:title "Immediate effects of dry needling and acupuncture at distant points in chronic neck pain: results of a randomized, double-blind, sham-controlled crossover trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Acupuncture points were selected based on TCM theory and varied individually.
Points were chosen based on pain localization and limited mobility.
Classical distant acupuncture points at the extremities and regional non-segmental points were used.
One to two ear points were chosen.
Specific points are not detailed in the paper but are referenced in another publication (Irnich, 1999).""" ;
