tara-kb:S-112625-536 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-536" ;
    dc:title "Effect of acupuncture treatment on chronic neck and shoulder pain in sedentary female workers: a 6-month and 3-year follow-up study" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Body electroacupuncture: Jingjiaji (4), ExHN; Jianjing (2), GB21; Fengmen (1), BL12; Dazhui (1), GV14; Jianzhongshu (1), SI15; Jianwaishu (1), SI14
Body acupuncture: Hegu (2), LI4; Quchi (2), LI11; Fengshi (2), GB31
Ear acupressure: Shenmen (1); Neck (1); Cervical spine (1); Shoulder (1); Shoulder joint (1); Shoulder-back (1)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group (CG) received a placebo treatment. The electroacupuncture was carried out without applying any voltage, but with an auditive signal. Body acupuncture was applied to points 10-40 mm distal to presumed real acupoints, and ear acupressure was applied on points 4-6 mm below to presumed real acupoints. This was a sham treatment designed to mimic real acupuncture without therapeutic effect." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Norway" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "Jingjiaji, ExHN, Jianjing, GB 21, Fengmen, BL 12, Dazhui, GV 14, Jianzhongshu, SI 15, Jianwaishu, SI 14, Hegu, LI 4, Quchi, LI 11, Fengshi, GB 31, Ear Shenmen, Neck, Cervical spine, Shoulder, Shoulder joint, Shoulder-back" ;
