    tara-kb:hasSampleSizeDetails "Total: 207; Crew et al., 2007: 21; Crew et al., 2010: 43; Bao et al., 2013: 47; Oh et al., 2013: 29; Mao et al., 2013: 67" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not mentioned (the paper indicates the use of sham acupuncture but does not provide specific details on the sham procedure such as needle type, location, or whether it was penetrating or non-penetrating)" ;
