tara-kb:S-112625-558 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-558" ;
    dc:title "EA versus sham acupuncture and no acupuncture for the control of acute and delayed chemotherapy-induced nausea and vomiting: a pilot study" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """True Acupuncture Points: ST36, PC6, LR3, LI4
Sham Acupuncture Points: 1 cun lateral to PC6, midpoint between ST36 and GB34, 1 cun medial to LI4, 1 cun lateral to LV3
Rationale: Chosen based on traditional use in treating nausea and vomiting, evidence from previous trials and systematic reviews, and traditional Chinese medicine textbooks.""" ;
