    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Needle type: Real acupuncture needles (sterile surgical stainless steel 0.20 mm√ó30 mm)
Quantity: Bilateral insertion
Size: 0.20 mm√ó30 mm
Location: Points adjacent to true acupuncture points (off channel)
Penetration: Superficial insertion (0.2-0.5 cm depth)
Manipulation: No manipulation, no de qi sensation
