    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Balk et al. (2009) used a sham needle with the Park Sham device, placement same as true acupuncture, electrostimulator turned on but wire clips disconnected (non-penetrating). Deng et al. (2013) used a sham needle with the Streitberger device (non-penetrating)." ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Two studies did not apply needle manipulation or stimulation.
