    dc:title "Acupuncture for Pain and Dysfunction After Neck Dissection: Results of a Randomized Controlled Trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Standard distal points: LI-4 (for pain of the face and neck), SP-6 (to harmonize organs and remove obstructions), GV-20 (to harmonize organs and remove obstructions), luozhen (for stiffness of the neck and shoulder), auricular shenman (to calm and relieve pain)
Customized points: zone distal points (front, middle, back) based on primary zone of pain; local ashi tender points based on sensitivity to palpation; bilateral point LI-2 for patients with dry mouth
Total number of acupoints: minimum of 8 points (14 needles), maximum of 26 points (39 needles)""" ;
