tara-kb:S-112625-577 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-577" ;
    dc:title "Acupuncture for the treatment of hot flashes in breast cancer patients, a randomized, controlled trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Traditional Acupuncture Points:
LIV3: In the depression distal to the junction of 1st and 2nd metatarsal bones
GB20: Below the occiput, in the hollow between the sternomastoid and trapezius muscles
LU7: Superior to the styloid process of the radius
KI3: In the depression between the tip of the tibial medial malleolus and the achilles tendon
SP6: On the medial side of lower leg, 3 cun superior to the medial malleolus
REN4: On the midline of the abdomen, 3 cun below the umbilicus
P7: Between palmaris longus and flexor carpi radialis at the wrist
LIV8: At the medial end of the traverse popliteal crease at the knee
Sham Acupuncture Points:
At 5, 10, and 15 cm proximal to the upper border of the patella
Over the highest point of the trapezius muscle""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "Sham acupuncture (SA) or minimal acupuncture: identical needles inserted only 2-3 mm deep at eight points well away from acupuncture and trigger points." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Norway" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "LIV 3, GB 20, LU 7, KI 3, SP 6, REN 4, P 7, LIV 8" ;
