Secondary outcome measure: Kupperman index""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each session: 30 minutes
Frequency: Twice weekly for the first 5 weeks, then once a week for the next 5 weeks
Depth of needle insertion: Between 0.5 and 3.0 cm
Duration needles were left in place: Not specified""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency """Frequency: Twice weekly for the first 5 weeks, then once a week for the next 5 weeks.
Duration: 30-minute sessions.
Total treatment period: 10 weeks.""" .

