    dc:title "Acupuncture and Acupressure for Chemotherapy-Induced Nausea and Vomiting: A Systematic Review" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Majority of trials used formula approach with points: "PC 6 Neiguan and ST 36 Zusanli"
Flexible point selection based on TCM principles in some trials
