Other points mentioned: "CV 12 Zhongwan and LI 4 Hegu" (less evidence)
Points used in some trials: "Near LU 7 and GB 34"
Sham point: "located 3‚Äì4 cm proximal to wrist crease; insertion of needle under the radius\"""" ;
