tara-kb:S-112625-59 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-59" ;
    dc:title "Evidence from RCTs on optimal acupuncture treatment for knee osteoarthritis--an exploratory review" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Vas study: EA to all local points except ST36, at the highest tolerable intensity
Berman study: EA to Xiyan only, not to muscle points
Witt study: Manual manipulation once per session
Scharf study: Manual manipulation twice per session
Most trials used at least 6 points, except Takeda (5), Sangdee (4), Yurtkuran (4), and Ng (2)
Threshold effect: At least four points may be sufficient
Electroacupuncture (EA) has more effect than manual stimulation
Specific points used in Vas study: EX32 ST36 SP9 GB34; SP6 KI3 ST40; LI4""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
