    dc:title "Clinical Observation on Treatment of Clearing the Governor Vessel and Refreshing the Mind Needling in" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """13 points of the Governor Vessel: Yaoshu (GV 2), Yaoyangguan (GV 3), Mingmen (GV 4), Xuanshu (GV 5), Jizhong (GV 6), Zhongshu (GV 7), Jinsuo (GV 8), Zhiyang (GV 9), Lingtai (GV 10), Shendao (GV 11), Shenzhu (GV 12), Taodao (GV 13), Dazhui (GV 14), Shenshu (BL 23)
Taixi (KI 3), Yanglingquan (GB 34), Zusanli (ST 36), Sanyinjiao (SP 6).
Refreshing the mind: Shenting (GV 24) toward Qianding (GV 21), Qianding (GV 21) toward Baihui (GV 20), Baihui (GV 20) toward Naohu (GV 17) and Sishencong (Ex-HN 1)
Scalp motor area, scalp foot motor sensory area, balance area
Speech areas 1, 2, and 3 for language disorders
Baihui and Qubin (GB 7)""" ;
