    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol "Hegu (LI 4), Zusanli (ST 36), Xingjian (LR 2), Sanyinjiao (SP 6), Shenmen (HT 7), Ahshi-point, Pishu (BL 20), Weishu (BL 21), Jiexu (ST 41), Quchi (LI 11), Guanyuan (CV 4), Shenshu (BL 23), Geshu (BL 17), Fengmen (BL 12), Waiguan (TE 5), Taichong (LR 3), Fenchi (GB 20), Jianjing (GB 21), Xinshu (BL 15), Dushu (BL 16), Zhibian (BL 54), Huantiao (GB 30), Huiyang (BL 35), Ququan (LR 8), Kufang (ST 15), Wuyi (ST 14), Taixi (KI 3), Neiguan (PC 6)." ;
