tara-kb:S-112625-601 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-601" ;
    dc:title """Acupuncture Combined with Music Therapy for Treatment of 30
Cases of Cerebral Palsy""" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Sishengzhen (Four Mind Points): anterior, posterior, medial, and lateral to Baihui (GV 20)
Bilateral Niesanzhen (Three temple points): 2 cun above ear apex, 1 cun anterior and posterior
Naosanzhen (Three Brain Points): Naohu (GV 17), bilateral Naokong (GB 19)
Zhisanzhen (Three Intelligence Points): Shenting (GV 24), bilateral Benshen (GB 13)
Shousanzhen (Three Hand Points): Quchi (LI 11), Waiguan (TE 5), Hegu (LI 4)
Shouzhizhen (Hand Intelligence Points): Neiguan (PC 6), Shenmen (HT 7), Laogong (PC 8)
Zuzhizhen (Foot Intelligence Points): Yongquan (KI 1), Quanzhong, medial Quanzhong
Zusanzhen (Three Foot Points): Zusanli (ST 36), Sanyinjiao (SP 6), Taichong (LR 3)
Auxiliary points:
Jiexi (ST 44), Taixi (KI 3), Kunlun (BL 60), Bafeng (EX LE10), Weizhong (BL 40) for paralyzed lower limbs
Baxie (EX UE9) for hand dysfunction
Lianquan (CV 23) for language disorders
Yangbai (GB 14), Taiyang (EX HN5), Jingming (BL 1), Sibai (ST 2) for strabismus
Cervical Jiaji points for feeble neck
Jiaji points for lumbar debility
Ermen (TE 21), Tinggong (SI 19), Tinghui (GB 2), Yifeng (TE 17) for hearing disorders
Dingshen I and II for mental retardation or absence of mind
Shenmai (BL 62), Zhaohai (KI 6) for epilepsy
Assisted points:
Governor meridian, Ganshu (BL 18), Shenshu (BL 23) for congenital deficiency
Shangwan (CV 13), Zhongwan (CV 12), Xiawan (CV 10), Juque (CV 14), Qihai (CV 6), Tianshu (ST 5) for malnutrition
Fenglong (ST 40), Geshu (BL 17) for obstruction""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group in this study is the acupuncture group (Group Acup.), which received simple acupuncture without music therapy. This group serves as a baseline to compare the effects of adding music therapy to acupuncture in the other group (Group Acup.+ M)." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "China" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "GV 20, GV 17, GB 19, GV 24, GB 13, LI 11, TE 5, LI 4, PC 6, HT 7, PC 8, KI 1, Quanzhong, ST 36, SP 6, LR 3, ST 44, KI 3, BL 60, EX LE10, BL 40, EX UE9, CV 23, GB 14, EX HN5, BL 1, ST 2, TE 21, SI 19, GB 2, TE 17, EX HN3, BL 62, KI 6, BL 18, BL 23, CV 13, CV 12, CV 10, CV 14, CV 6, ST 5, ST 40, BL 17" ;
