Secondary outcome measures: Changes in clinical symptoms such as slow reaction, dull facial expression, glossolalia, limb spasm, feeble and weak limbs, clumsy actions, restlessness, salivation, enuresis, and convulsion""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "30 minutes (duration of needle retention during a session)" ;
