    dc:title "Acupuncture for Treatment of Insomnia in Patients With Traumatic Brain Injury: A Pilot Intervention Study" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol "Kidney 3, Heart 3, Bladder 60, Liver 3, Large intestine 4, Master of the Heart (Pericardium) 7, Governor Vessel 20. Ear points: Tranquilizer and Shen Men. Additional points for \"higher dose\" protocol: Spleen 6, Stomach 43, Heart 7, Liver 2, Kidney 10, GB20, CV23, ear point sympathetic. Body points placed bilaterally; ear points placed on one ear or the other. Selection determined by principal investigator based on individual response and constitutional health." ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Pilot Study" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group received basic education on behavioral interventions for insomnia and continued with their existing medication regimen without any specific intervention like acupuncture or sham acupuncture." ;
