    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol "Bilateral Hegu (LI 4); Bilateral Taichong (LR 3); Yangbai (GB 14) penetrating Yuyao (EX HN4); Quanliao (SI 18) penetrating Dicang (ST 4); Yifeng (TE 17); Yingxiang (LI 20) on the affected side; Bilateral Fengchi (GB 20); Bilateral Waiguan (TE 5); Yangbai (GB 14) penetrating Zhanzu (BL 2); Jiache (ST 6) penetrating Quanliao (SI 18); Qianzheng (EX); Chengjiang (CV 24) on the affected side. Points selected based on Hand and Foot Yangming and Hand and Foot Shaoyang Meridians." ;
