tara-kb:S-112625-635 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-635" ;
    dc:title "Acupuncture for cancer-related fatigue in lung cancer patients: a randomized, double blind, placebo-controlled pilot trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """LI-4 (Union Valley): On the top side of the hand, on the web between thumb and index finger, on the radial side of the second metacarpal bone.
Ren-6 (Sea of Qi): On the anterior median line of the lower abdomen, 1.5 cun below the umbilicus.
St-36 (Leg Three Li): On the front of the leg, one hand width (4 fingers) below the kneecap, on the outside, in the depression between the shinbone and the leg muscle.
KI-3 (Great Stream): On the medial aspect of the foot, posterior to the medial malleolus, in the depression between the tip of the medial malleolus and tendo calcaneus.
Sp-6 (Three Yin Intersection): On the medial aspect of the lower leg, 3 cun directly above the tip of the medial malleolus on the posterior border of the tibia.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT), specifically a pilot RCT" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group used in this study was a placebo control group that received sham acupuncture using the Placebo Park Sham Research Needle Device." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "China" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "LI 4, Ren 6, ST 36, KI 3, SP 6" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupointsMapped TARA:0859695,
        TARA:4362146,
        TARA:4385250,
        TARA:6463344,
        TARA:8833337 ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupointsMappedCurie "{\"TARA:0859695\": \"LI 4\", \"TARA:8833337\": \"CV 6\", \"TARA:6463344\": \"ST 36\", \"TARA:4362146\": \"KI 3\", \"TARA:4385250\": \"SP 6\"}"^^rdf:JSON ;
    tara-kb:hasMappedWesternCondition HP:0012378 ;
    tara-kb:hasNeedlingDetails "0.5-1.5 cun (a size range of combination of the index finger, middle finger, and ring finger)" ;
    tara-kb:hasOCSIAppraisalID tara-kb:O-112625-635 ;
    tara-kb:hasReportingPublicationID tara-kb:A-112625-635 ;
    tara-kb:hasSampleSizeDetails "Total sample size: 28; Active acupuncture group: 14; Placebo control group: 14" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Sham device: Placebo Park Sham Research Needle Device (Acuprime, Exeter, UK)
Needle type: Sterilized sham needle in a single guide tube
Quantity and size: Not specified
Location: Not explicitly mentioned as real points or non-points/off-meridian
Penetration: Non-penetrating, with gentle tapping to insert approximately 5 mm""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "Manual stimulation was used to achieve Bde-qi (an irradiating feeling) during each session." ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified (the paper does not provide a specific TCM term or diagnosis for CRF)" ;
