Secondary outcome measure: Influence of acupuncture on patients' quality of life (QOL) using the Functional Assessment of Cancer Therapy-Lung Cancer Subscale (FACT-LCS)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each acupuncture session: 45 minutes
Duration needles were left in place: Not specified""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Twice per week for 4 weeks, with each session lasting 45 minutes. Followed by 2 weeks of follow-up. Total of 8 sessions." .

