Sham Acupuncture Points: Located 2 cun laterally to true acupuncture points, between main channels
Technique: Leopard spot technique""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT) with a crossover design" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group in this study is the sham acupuncture group, where participants received acupuncture at non-therapeutic points. The study uses a crossover design, so each participant experiences both the true and sham acupuncture treatments, serving as their own control." ;
