Balk et al. 2009: Sham acupuncture (telescoping blunt-edged needles at the same points as real acupuncture)
Mao et al. 2014: Sham acupuncture (non-penetrating needles at non-acupuncture points)
Smith et al. 2013: Sham acupuncture (non-invasive sham needle with the Park device at fixed sham points)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Electrical stimulation (electroacupuncture) was used in two trials.
Moxibustion (thermal stimulation) was used in two trials.
Manual manipulation to achieve "De Qi" (sensation of soreness, tingling) was used in several trials.
Some trials used a "needle grab" sensation or perpendicular insertion without specific stimulation.""" ;
