    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Systematic Review" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Sham laser groups were used in four studies.
Dietary or exercise-based interventions were used as control groups in three studies.
Specific examples include:
Tseng et al: Sham-controlled crossover trial.
El-Mekawy et al: Diet-exercise intervention as a control group.
Wozniak et al: Calorie-restricted diet alone as a control group.
Hassan et al: Nutritional intervention and manual acupuncture as control groups.""" ;
