    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Main points: Huantiao (GB30), Yanglingquan (GB34), Sanyinjiao (SP6), Zusanli (ST36), Ganshu (BL18), Pishu (BL20), Shenshu (BL23), Feishu (BL58), Yishu, Taibai (SP3), Zutonggu, Qihai (CV6), Guanyuan (CV4), Fenglong (ST40)
