Xiyan: Knee pain, weakness of the lower extremities
Kunlun (UB 60): Headache, neck rigidity, pain in the shoulder, back and arm, swelling and pain of the heel
Xuanzhong (GB 39): Muscular atrophy of the lower limbs, spastic pain of the leg
Sanyinjiao (Sp 6): Abdominal pain, oedema, paralysis and pain of the lower extremities, muscular atrophy
Taixi (Kid 3): Pain in lower back, insomnia, impotence""" ;
