Selection was based on Traditional Chinese Medicine theory of 'Bi' syndrome.
Points serve as both distal and local points.
Anatomical locations depicted in Figure 2.
Needle insertion depths: LI11, TE5, ST36, GB36, GB39 to 20 mm; LI4 to 10 mm.""" ;
