    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "Sham acupuncture: The sham acupuncture involved puncturing the skin to a depth of 2 mm and then quickly withdrawing the needle, with no actual acupuncture stimulation. This group served as a control to measure the placebo effect." ;
