Physician's global assessment
Patient's global assessment
HAQ
DAS 28 score
Number of patients who achieved ACR 20 at week 10""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each acupuncture session: 40 minutes
Duration needles were left in place: 30 minutes""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Twice weekly for 40 minutes per session, with a total of 20 sessions over 10 weeks." .

tara-kb:S-112625-670 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-670" ;
    dc:title "Effects of Music in Combination with Vibration in Acupuncture Points on the Treatment of Fibromyalgia" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """IG-4 (64 Hz): on the right hand between the two metacarpi
F-3 (32 Hz): on the left foot between the two metatarsi
yintang (64 Hz): on the glabella between the eyes
Ren-15 (48 Hz): on the tip of the xiphoid appendix
Ren-4 (32 Hz): on the pelvis (4 inches below the navel)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group received no stimulation. Participants wore earphones and had skin transducers attached but did not receive any actual sound or vibration." ;
