    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Zusanli (ST-36): On the anterior lateral side of the leg, 3 cm below Dubi (ST 35), one finger‚Äôs breadth from the anterior crest of the tibia.
Sanyinjiao (SP-6): On the medial line of the leg, 3 cm above the tip of the medial malleolus, posterior to the medial border of the tibia.
Chengshan (BL-57): On the posterior midline of the leg, between Weizhong (BL40) and Kunlun (BL-60), in the depression formed below the gastrocnemius muscle belly when the leg is stretched or the heel is lifted.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The Control group consisted of participants who lay on their backs for 20 minutes after modelization without receiving any specific intervention like acupuncture or moxibustion." ;
