    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (no sham acupuncture group was used)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Needles were stimulated through manual manipulation by twirling them using a uniform reinforcing-reducing method for 1 minute.
