    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The stimulation was electrical stimulation (electroacupuncture) using an electrical stimulator (ITO ES160, Japan) with a continuous 0.4 ms square wave pulse at 4 Hz frequency and constant current up to the subjects' tolerance level. De qi sensation was sought. Needles were left for 30 minutes before removal." ;
