    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol "Points were chosen based on TCM theory and were partially individualized." ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Systematic Review" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Sham moxibustion: Used in three RCTs to compare with moxibustion for pain reduction in knee OA.
Conventional oral drug therapies: Eleven RCTs compared moxibustion with these as controls.
Intra-articular injection: Two RCTs used this as a control to compare with moxibustion.
Topical drug therapy: One RCT compared moxibustion with this as a control.
Usual care: One RCT compared moxibustion plus usual care with usual care alone.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "China, South Korea" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasMappedWesternCondition MONDO:0005178 ;
