    tara-kb:hasReportingPublicationID tara-kb:A-112625-691 ;
    tara-kb:hasSampleSizeDetails "Total sample size: 2196 participants; Individual study sample sizes: varied from 56 to 212 participants" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Sham moxibustion involved using a device that insulates patients from the radiant heat produced during moxibustion.
The sham procedure was designed to mimic the real moxibustion procedure but without the actual therapeutic effect, as patients did not feel the heat.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "Not applicable (the paper discusses moxibustion, not acupuncture or needle stimulation)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified (the paper does not explicitly state the condition in Traditional Chinese Medicine terminology)" ;
