    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Electroacupuncture point: Zusanli (stomach channel), located on the left leg, four finger widths below the depression inferior to the patella, lateral to the patellar ligament, and one finger breadth from the anterior crest of the tibia.
Placebo acupuncture point: Lateral aspect of the nondominant forearm, one third of the way between the elbow and wrist.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Placebo acupuncture: Sham intervention at a non-therapeutic acupoint on the lateral aspect of the forearm.
Saline infiltration: Used as a control condition in some experiments.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Canada" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "ST 36, lateral aspect of forearm" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupointsMapped TARA:6463344 ;
