    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Qihai (REN-6), Shuifen (REN-9), Right Shuidao (ST-28), Left Shuidao (ST-28), Right Siman (K-14), Left Siman (K-14), Zusanli (ST-26), Fenglong (ST-40), Sanginjao (SP-6)
Locations: Abdomen and lower legs
Selection criterion: Theory of Chinese medicine and clinical experience
Insertion depth: Approximately 2.5 cm
Manipulation: Rotating back and forth for lower leg points
Electrical stimulation: Applied to abdominal points with specific pole configurations""" ;
