Electrical stimulation (electroacupuncture) was applied to abdominal acupuncture points using an electrical stimulator with specific parameters.
The sensation sought was 'De-Xi', a feeling of heaviness around the needle insertion site.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified (the paper does not explicitly mention a TCM term for obesity)" ;
