    dc:title "Auricular acupuncture for pain relief after ambulatory knee surgery: a randomized trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Auricular acupuncture points: knee joint, shenmen, lung (ipsilateral to the surgery site)
Sham control points: non-acupuncture points on the helix (ipsilateral to the site of surgery)""" ;
