tara-kb:S-112625-76 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-76" ;
    dc:title "A Randomized Controlled Trial of Acupuncture for Osteoarthritis of the Knee: Effects of Patient-Provider Communication" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Traditional Chinese Acupuncture (TCA) points: Xi Yan, He Ding, GB 34, Sp 6, Sp 9, Ear-Knee, and 1-2 tender Ashi points proximal to the knee.
Sham points: AC-LE-1 (1.0 cun below and 0.5 cun lateral to ST 36), AC-LE-2 (1.0 cun lateral to and 1.0 cun above ST 40), AC-LE-3 (above the superolateral border of the patella, 1.0 cun lateral to the stomach meridian), AC-LE-4 (4.0 cun above the superolateral border of the patella, 1.0 cun lateral to the stomach meridian), SI 7, and AC-UE-1 (located in the middle of SI 5 and SI 8 points).""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control groups used in the study were a waiting list group (non-intervention control) and a sham acupuncture group (active placebo control). The study also assessed the impact of acupuncturists' communication styles (high expectations vs. neutral expectations) on treatment outcomes." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "United States (specifically in Texas)" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "Xi Yan, He Ding, GB 34, Sp 6, Sp 9, Ashi points" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupointsMapped TARA:0926802,
