tara-kb:S-112625-763 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-763" ;
    dc:title "Sensory stimulation (acupuncture) for the treatment of idiopathic anterior knee pain" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """ST 34: In m. vastus lateralis, 2 cun above the laterosuperior border of the patella
ST 36: In m. tibialis anterior, one finger breadth lateral to the inferior end of the tibial tuberosity
ST 38: In m. tibialis anterior, 3 cun distal to ST 36
SP 9: In m. gastrocnemius, on the level of the lower border of the tibial tuberosity in the depression of the medial border of the tibia
SP 10: In m. vastus medialis, 2 cun above the mediosuperior border of the patella
GB 34: In m. extensor digitorum longus, in the depression anterior and inferior to the head of fibulae
Minimal superficial acupuncture points: One inch away from traditional points, still in the same dermatome""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group used in the study was the minimal superficial acupuncture group, which served as a placebo control to compare with the deep acupuncture group." ;
