    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Sham procedure: Minimal super cial acupuncture
Needle type: Real needles (0.15 mm diameter, 15 mm long)
Quantity: Six needles
Location: One inch away from traditional points, within the same dermatome
Penetration: Subcutaneous
Stimulation: No electrical stimulation""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Group A (Electro-acupuncture): Electrical stimulation with 2 Hz, constant biphasic square pulses, pulse-width 180 ms. Needles were twirled to evoke de Qi sensation.
Group B (Minimal superficial acupuncture): No electrical stimulation. Needles were inserted subcutaneously without any further stimulation.""" ;
