    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measures:
Bladder function (assessed through urodynamic examination parameters: first voiding desire, maximal cystometric capacity, maximal flow rate, postvoided residual urine, and bladder compliance)
Prevalence of sensory loss, incontinence, and urinary retention
Secondary outcome measures:
Lymphocyst formation
Lymphedema
Ileus
Ureterovaginal fistula
Wound infection
Urinary tract infection""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "30 minutes (duration of each acupuncture session); 30 minutes (duration needles were left in place during a session)" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Daily for five consecutive days, with each session lasting 30 minutes." .

