    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Cranial acupoints: Baihui (DU20), Yintang (EX-HN3), left Sishencong (EX-HN1) and Toulinqi (GB15), right Sishencong (EX-HN1) and Toulinqi (GB15), bilateral Shuaigu (GB8), bilateral Taiyang (EX-HN5), and bilateral Touwei (ST8)
Body acupoints: bilateral Sanyinjiao (SP6), bilateral Taichong (LR3), Shenmen (HE7), and Neiguan (PC6)
Selection based on empirical evidence from a recent systematic review and expert consensus related to traditional Chinese medicine theory for treating depression""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT), Pilot Study" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Control Group: Non-invasive sham acupuncture using Streitberger's placebo needles.
