tara-kb:S-112625-789 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-789" ;
    dc:title "Acupuncture as an adjunct to standard treatment for pelvic girdle pain in pregnant women: randomised double-blinded controlled trial comparing acupuncture with non-penetrating sham acupuncture" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Selection based on clinical experience and expert knowledge
Eight or nine tender acupuncture points and one or two trigger points in the same segments as PGP
