tara-kb:S-112625-801 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-801" ;
    dc:title "Effects of acupuncture on the outcome of in vitro fertilisation and intracytoplasmic sperm injection in women with polycystic ovarian syndrome" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """SP6: Crossing point of the three Yin meridian of the foot, for general homeostatic effect.
LR3: Source point of the LR channel, for harmonizing effects.
LI4: Used in combination with LR3 to open relevant meridians and calm the mind.
CV4: Controls all the Yin channels, effective for reproductive function and pelvic disorders.
GV20: Sedating and relaxing effect, effective in reproductive function.
ST36: Used for its effects on pelvic organs.
Ovary and Uterus auricular points: Used bilaterally for reproductive function.
SP10: Used in pre-ET and post-ET sessions.
PC6: Used in pre-ET and post-ET sessions.
ST29: Used in pre-ET and post-ET sessions.
Shenmen auricular point: Used in pre-ET and post-ET sessions.""" ;
