Group II:
After ET: San Jiao (SJ9), SJ12 (Xiaoluo), gallbladder (GB31), GB32 (Zhongdu), GB34 (Yang ling qua)
Ear points: ear point 17 (Shangzhi), ear point 14 (Feng si), ear point 8 (Sisheng), ear point 53 (Jian)""" ;
