SP8: Used to improve blood perfusion and energy to the uterus.
SP10: Used to improve blood perfusion and energy to the uterus.
ST36: Used to improve blood perfusion and energy to the uterus.
ST29: Used to improve blood perfusion and energy to the uterus.
LI4: "Four gates points"; used to open relevant meridians and calm the mind.
LR3: "Four gates points"; used to open relevant meridians and calm the mind.
PC6: Used to relax the patient.
DU20 (Baihui): Used to relax the patient.
Ren 3: Used in the additional session for the ACU 2 group.""" ;
