tara-kb:S-112625-808 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-808" ;
    dc:title "Influence of acupuncture stimulation on pregnancy rates for women undergoing embryo transfer" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Acupuncture points were selected based on TCM diagnosis.
Liver 4 and governing vessel 20 were excluded from the treatment protocol.
Sham acupuncture points used in the control group:
On the foot anterior to the junction of the third and fourth metatarsals.
4 cun below and two fingerbreadths lateral to the knee.
2 cun above kidney 3 between the spleen and kidney meridians.
3 cun lateral to the midline level with conception vessel 5 and 7.
2 cun above the wrist crease between the lung and pericardium meridians.
Specific acupuncture points for the treatment group are not specified.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group received noninvasive sham acupuncture with a placebo needle. Sham acupuncture points were used, located close to but not on real acupuncture points, and a blunted placebo needle was used to prevent skin penetration." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Australia" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasMappedWesternCondition HP:0000789 ;
