Quantity: Not specified
Size: 0.30 mm œ´ 30 mm
Location: Close to but not on real acupuncture points
Penetration: Non-penetrating
Other details: Manual stimulation by lifting and thrusting the handle, running a fingernail along the handle; bilateral stimulation for approximately 3 minutes; treatment duration of approximately 25 minutes""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The stimulation was manual manipulation to elicit the Deqi response (needling sensation). Needles were retained for 25 minutes per treatment." ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "- Kidney yang - Kidney yin - Blood deficiency - Blood stagnation - Damp - Qi stagnation" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Infertility" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings "No" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measure: Pregnancy (defined as the number of couples achieving a clinical pregnancy)
Secondary outcome measures:
Implantation (defined as demonstration of a gestational sac on ultrasound scan)
Ongoing pregnancy rate at 18 weeks
Adverse events
Health status (assessed using the MOS 36 Short Form Health Survey)""" ;
