    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group in this study is the Conventional Analgesia (CA) group, which received conventional analgesia including a paracervical block with lidocaine, sedative pre-medication with oral flunitrazepam and rectal paracetamol, and intravenous alfentanil." ;
