tara-kb:S-112625-81 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-81" ;
    dc:title "Electroacupuncture versus Diclofenac in symptomatic treatment of Osteoarthritis of the knee: a randomized controlled trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Dubi (ST-35): In the depression of the lateral part of the patella ligament, when the knee is bent. Slightly towards the medial side.
Medial Xiyan (Extra): In the depression of the medial part of the patella ligament, when the knee is bent. Slightly towards the lateral side.
Trigger point: At the level of the joint line, midpoint between the medial Xiyan and Ququan. Straight insertion.
Ququan (Liv-8): At the medial end of the knee crease, in front of the semi-membranous muscle behind the lower end of the femur. Straight insertion.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Placebo group: Received placebo tablet and placebo EA (patch electrodes without stimulation).
Diclofenac group: Received diclofenac tablet and placebo EA.
EA group: Received placebo tablet and true EA.
Combined group: Received diclofenac tablet and true EA.""" ;
