tara-kb:S-112625-814 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-814" ;
    dc:title "Acupuncture and assisted reproductive technology" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """GV 20 (Baihui): on the midline of the head, 7 cun directly above the posterior hairline, approximately on the midpoint of the line connecting the apexes of the two auricles.
LI 4 (Hegu): in the middle of the 2nd metacarpal bone on the radial side.
SP6 (Sanyinjiao): 3 cm directly above the tip of the medial malleolus on the posterior border of the tibia.
ST29 (Guilai): 2 cm lateral to the AML level with CV 3.
Other points mentioned in tables at the end of the paper include:
Ren 3 (Zhongji), RN 4 (Guanyuan), RN6 (Qihai), KI 3 (Taixi), KI 11 (Henggu), TE 5 (Weiguan), SP 8 (Diji), SP 10 (Xuehai), ST28, ST36 (Zusanli), PC6 (Neiguan)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Systematic Review of Randomized Controlled Trials (RCTs)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """No intervention control groups: Eight studies had no intervention control groups where participants did not receive any acupuncture treatment.
Conventional medical analgesia control groups: Five studies used control groups with conventional medical analgesia instead of acupuncture.
Sham acupuncture needle control groups: Six studies used sham acupuncture needle control groups using Strietberger sham acupuncture needles.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Not specified (the paper is a systematic review and does not specify a single country where the study was conducted)" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified (the paper does not mention any dataset link or availability of related datasets)" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "GV 20, LI 4, SP 6, ST 29, Ren 3, RN 4, RN6, KI 3, KI 11, TE 5, SP 8, SP 10, ST29, ST36, PC6, LI 10" ;
