Specific subgroup sample sizes:
Ongoing pregnancy rate: 460/1451 in acupuncture group, 427/1356 in control group
Studies with controls without sham acupuncture or needling: 183/514 in acupuncture group, 143/410 in control group
Studies with controls with sham acupuncture: 277/937 in acupuncture group, 284/946 in control group""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Sham needles used: Streitberger placebo needle (blunted tip, no skin penetration)
Sham procedure: Sham needles used in control groups to simulate acupuncture without actual penetration
Real needles in non-relevant points: Used in some studies as another form of sham control""" ;
