    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Karlson and Bennicke (2013): Acupuncture LIV (liver) 2; Acupressure LU 7, REN 17, REN 22, LI 4, PC 6, SP 6, SP 10, ST 36, ST 40, K 3, K 7, DU 14, DU 20, Dingchuan
