Karlson and Bennicke (2013): 64 patients
Scheewe et al. (2011): 46 (acupuncture), 47 (control)
Nedeljkoviƒá et al. (2008): 50 (each group)
Stockert et al. (2007): 7 (acupuncture), 9 (control)
