Nedeljkoviƒá et al. (2008): 10 sessions over 12 days
Stockert et al. (2007): Once-weekly laser acupuncture for 7 weeks
Gruber et al. (2002): Single sessions on consecutive days
Fung et al. (1986): Two weekly sessions
Chow et al. (1983): Two weekly sessions""" .

