    tara-kb:hasMappedWesternCondition MONDO:0006031 ;
    tara-kb:hasNeedlingDetails """Traditional Chinese Acupuncture (TCA): approximately 0.5 cun (facial/hand/feet area) to a maximum of 1.3 cun (arms/legs/trunk area)
Sham Group: maximum depth 0.25 cun""" ;
