    tara-kb:hasSampleSizeDetails """Total participants analyzed: 44
Acupuncture group: 30
Control group: 14""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (no sham acupuncture group was used)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The stimulation involved manual manipulation (twirling of needles) to evoke a needle reaction, followed by electrical stimulation using an electrical stimulator at a low frequency of 10 Hz for 30 minutes. The sensations sought included soreness, numbness, and distension." ;
