    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group used in this study was a sham laser treatment group. In this group, the laser was placed on various points without being activated, and both the therapist and patient wore protective goggles. This was maintained for 20 minutes to serve as a placebo comparison to the acupuncture group." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "China, United Kingdom, Australia, Germany, Austria, Sweden, Italy, Korea" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "Not specified" ;
