    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Chronic sinusitis" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings "Not specified (the paper does not provide a specific list of acupoints used in the TCA group)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measure: Change in HRQoL assessed using the Chronic Sinusitis Survey (CSS)
Secondary outcome measure: Change in HRQoL assessed using the Short Form 36 (SF-36)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Total sample size: 65
Conventional medical therapy group: 21
