tara-kb:S-112625-853 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-853" ;
    dc:title "Effect of adding a Chinese herbal preparation to acupuncture for seasonal allergic rhinitis: randomised doubleblind controlled trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Key points: yingxiang (LI 20), yintang (extra point), fengchi (GB 20)
Supplementary points:
Lung qi deficiency syndrome: feishu (BL 13), taiyuan (LU 9)
Spleen qi deficiency syndrome: pishu (BL 20), zusanli (ST 36)
Kidney qi deficiency syndrome: shenshu (BL 23), qihai (CV 6)
Techniques and depths:
Yingxiang (LI 20): Transversely, upwards, and medially to bridge of nose, depth 20 mm
Yintang (EX 1): Transversely, downwards, and towards root of nose, depth 15 mm
Fengchi (GB 20): Obliquely, downwards, and centrally to tip of nose, depth 15 mm
Feishu (BL 13): Obliquely to spine, depth 20 mm
Taiyuan (LU 9): Obliquely and upwards to radius, depth 10 mm
Pishu (BL 20): Obliquely to spine, depth 20 mm
Zusanli (ST 36): Obliquely between tibia and fibula, depth 40 mm
Shenshu (BL 23): Obliquely to spine, depth 20 mm
Qihai (CV 6): Perpendicularly at anterior midline below umbilicus, depth 20 mm""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control group consisted of 32 patients who received acupuncture plus placebo capsules containing 500 mg of soy polysaccharides, three times daily, for 8 weeks." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "Australia" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "LI 20, Yintang, GB 20, BL 13, LU 9, BL 20, ST 36, BL 23, CV 6" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupointsMapped TARA:0992296,
