    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """LI 4 Hegu: Between the first and second metacarpal bones, on the radial side, in level with the middle of the second metacarpal bone and at the highest point of the interosseus dorsalis muscle when the thumb is adducted. Depth: 0.5‚Äì0.8 cun, Angle: 90¬∞
