LI 15 Jianyu: Distal to the anterior part of acromion, in the anterior hollow in the deltoid muscle, appearing during abduction of the glenohumeral joint. Depth: 0.7‚Äì1 cun, Angle: 45¬∞ distal, longitudinal to the humerus
LU 1 Zhongfu: Anterior of the processus coracoideus. Depth: 0.3‚Äì0.5 cun, Angle: 90¬∞ toward the palpable part of the processus coracoideus
TE 14 Jianliao: Distal to the posterior part of acromion, in the dorsal hollow in the deltoid muscle, appearing during abduction of the glenohumeral joint. Depth: 0.7‚Äì1 cun, Angle: 45¬∞ distal, longitudinal to the humerus""" ;
