tara-kb:S-112625-876 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-876" ;
    dc:title "Randomised trial of long term effect of acupuncture for shoulder pain" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Jianyu LI 15: superior to deltoid muscle in a depression anterior and inferior to the acromion when the arm is abducted.
Jianliao TE 14: posterior to Jianyu in the depression inferior and posterior to the acromion when the arm is abducted.
Yanglingquan GB 34: on leg lateral side in the depression anterior and inferior to the head of the fibula.
Zhongping Extra point: 1-2 cm below Zusanli ST 36 (3 cun under knee interarticular level at anterior paratibial line)""" ;
