    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "Not specified (the paper does not provide specific details on the duration of each acupuncture session or how long the needles were left in place)" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency """Frequency: At least once weekly
Duration: Number of sessions varied from 1 to 30
Exceptions: Two RCTs provided acupuncture only once""" .

