    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Systematic Review of Randomized Controlled Trials (RCTs)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "The control groups used in the studies were pharmacological treatments, specifically H1-antihistamines (loratadine or cetirizine). There were no control groups using no treatment, placebo, or sham acupuncture." ;
