    tara-kb:hasNeedlingDetails "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasOCSIAppraisalID tara-kb:O-112625-883 ;
    tara-kb:hasReportingPublicationID tara-kb:A-112625-883 ;
    tara-kb:hasSampleSizeDetails """Total participants: 406
Participants in acupuncture vs. medication group: 180
Detailed breakdown by study:
Chen 2009: 30 (acupuncture), 30 (loratadine)
Tang 2006: 30 (acupuncture), 30 (loratadine)
Gao et al. 2009: 30 (acupuncture), 30 (cetirizine)
Xie et al. 2009: 30 (electroacupuncture plus mizolastine), 30 (mizolastine)
Xu and Zhang 2011: 35 (acupuncture plus cetirizine), 35 (cetirizine)
Song et al. 2005: 47 (acupuncture plus cetirizine), 49 (cetirizine)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails "Not applicable (no sham acupuncture group was used in the included trials)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails """Electroacupuncture was used in 2 RCTs, which involves electrical stimulation.
Manual acupuncture was used in 4 RCTs, which typically involves manual manipulation of the needles.
No information on the type of sensation sought during stimulation.
No mention of thermal (moxibustion) or laser stimulation.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Chronic urticaria" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings "Yes, acupuncture was found to be effective compared to the control/sham group(s) based on the primary outcome(s) of global symptom improvement, with statistical significance (p-values of 0.003 and <0.01)." ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome: Global symptom improvement (measured by urticaria activity score (UAS) or other validated scales)
Secondary outcomes: Quality of life, recurrence rate during the follow-up period""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "Not specified (the paper does not provide information on the duration of each acupuncture session or how long the needles were left in place)" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency """Duration: 2 weeks (2 trials), 4 weeks (4 trials)
Frequency: Ranged from once per day to twice per week""" .

