    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Obstructive Sleep Apnea Syndrome (OSAS)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings """Direct quote: "A small difference was found between acupuncture and placebo acupuncture: standardised mean difference -0.17 (95% confidence interval -0.26 to -0.08), corresponding to 4 mm (2 mm to 6 mm) on a 100 mm visual analogue scale."
Effectiveness: Maybe/Inconclusive""" ;
