    tara-kb:hasSampleSizeDetails """Total participants initially randomized: 35
Total participants who completed the study: 25
Participants in true auricular acupuncture group: 12 at baseline, 9 at 1 month, 8 at 2 months
Participants in sham auricular acupuncture group: 12 at baseline, 8 at 1 month, 8 at 2 months
Participants in wait list control group: 11 at baseline, 9 at 1 month, 9 at 2 months""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Sham procedure: Used non acupuncture points on the helix of the ear.
Needle type: DBC Brand Spring Handle Needles, size 0.16 ‚Ä¢ 15 mm.
Quantity: Five needles per ear.
Location: Non acupuncture points on the helix of the ear.
Penetration: Penetrating, with needle depth depending on auricle thickness.
De Qi response: Not sought during needle insertion.""" ;
