    tara-kb:hasSampleSizeDetails "Not specified (the paper does not provide a total sample size or detailed breakdown for all included trials)" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Sham procedure: Stainless needle, stainless steel pellets, Junci Medulla (rush pith)
Details: Used as placebo controls in some studies; no specific details on location, penetration, quantity, or size""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "Not specified (the paper does not provide details on how the devices were stimulated or if any specific sensation was sought)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified (the paper does not provide a specific TCM term for insomnia)" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Insomnia" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings """Direct quote: "The meta-analysis showed a significant effect of magnetic pellets AA for sleep efficiency compared with placebo AA (n = 112, WMD, %, 7.5, 95% CI 2.2 to 12.9, p = 0.006, heterogeneity: tau 2 = 0, v 2 = 0.22, p = 0.64, I 2 = 0%)."
Effectiveness: Maybe/Inconclusive""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary outcome measure(s): Sleep efficiency
Secondary outcome measure(s): Sleep diaries, medical interviews, questionnaires, actigraphic monitoring""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration "Not specified (the paper does not provide information on the duration of each acupuncture session or how long the needles were left in place)" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "Not specified (the paper does not provide specific details about the frequency or duration of treatments)" .

