tara-kb:S-112625-910 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-910" ;
    dc:title "Abdominal Acupuncture for Insomnia in Women: A Randomized Controlled Clinical Trial" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Master Acupoints:
Zhongwan (CV 12): located on the midline, 4 cuns above the umbilicus
Xiawan (CV 10): located on the midline, 2 cuns above the umbilicus
Guanyuan (CV 4): located on the midline, 3 cuns below the umbilicus
Qihai (CV 6): located on the midline, 1.5 cuns below the umbilicus
Adjunctive Acupoints:
Shangqu (KI 17): located 0.5 cuns aside from the midline, 2 cuns above the umbilicus
Huaroumen (ST 24): located 2 cuns aside from the midline, 1 cun above the umbilicus
Xiafengshidian: located at the same level as Qihai, 2.5 cuns from Qihai
Qipang: located at the same level as Qihai, 0.5 cun aside from Qihai""" ;
