    tara-kb:hasSampleSizeDetails """Exercise: Total sample sizes ranged from 1993 to 4138 across 71 unique trials; additional trials had sample sizes ‚â•100 in 18 trials and <100 in 33 trials.
Yoga: Sample size range from 12 to 313 across 10 trials; additional trials had sample sizes ranging from 60 to 159.
Psychological therapies: Sample size range from 18 to 409 across 28 trials; additional trials had sample sizes ranging from 54 to 701.
Multidisciplinary rehabilitation: Sample size range from 20 to 542 across 41 trials; additional trials had sample sizes of 20, 20, and 70.
Acupuncture: Sample size range from 40 to 300 for acute/subacute low back pain; from 16 to 2831 for chronic low back pain; additional trials had sample sizes ranging from 80 to 275.
Massage: Sample size range from 39 to 262 across 13 trials; additional trials had sample sizes ranging from 15 to 579.
