tara-kb:S-112625-956 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-956" ;
    dc:title "Auricular acupuncture for cocaine dependence" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Standard NADA protocol: lung, liver, kidney, sympathetic, shen men
Variations: four points (Avants 2000, Lipton 1994, Margolin 2002), three ear points (Bullock 1997), three ear points and one in the hand (Avants 1995)
Sham acupuncture: non-specific points near addiction-specific points, points relevant to back pain
Locations not consistently described across studies""" ;
