Technique for Hegu group: Insertion in three different directions following the meridian""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails "Usual Care group: Participants received no study-related care but continued with their usual medical care, which included massage, physical therapy, and medication (mostly nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs). All participants also received a self-care book with information on managing flare-ups, exercise, and lifestyle modification." ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "China" ;
