Meng et al.: 10 sessions, 2x/week for 5 weeks.
Molsberger et al.: 12 sessions, 3x/week.
Thomas et al.: Up to 10 individualized sessions over 3 months.
Tsui and Cheing: 8 sessions, 2x/week.
Witt et al.: Up to 15 individualized sessions.
Yeung et al.: 12 sessions, 3x/week for 4 weeks.""" .

tara-kb:S-112625-980 a TARA:6701896,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    dc:identifier "tara-kb:S-112625-980" ;
    dc:title "A Randomized Controlled Trial of Auricular Acupuncture for Cocaine Dependence" ;
    tara-kb:hasAcupunctureProtocol """Active Acupuncture Points:
Sympathetic: located in the deltoid fossa at the junction of the infra-antihelix crus and the medial order of the helix
Lung: located in the center of the cavum concha
Liver: located in the posterior to upper portion of the helix crus
Shen men: located in the inferior corner of the bifurcating point of the antihelix
Control Points:
Zone 1: located on the helix from the high point of the helix to just above the superior border of Darwin's tubercle
Zone 2: located on the helix at the level of Darwin's tubercle, from just below the superior order of the tubercle to just above the inferior order of the tubercle
Zone 3: located from just below the inferior order of Darwin's tubercle to approximately level with the end of the crus of the helix
Avoided Points:
"Liver Yang" points""" ;
    tara-kb:hasClinicalTrialType "Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT)" ;
    tara-kb:hasControlGroupsDetails """Needle-insertion control condition: Four needles inserted into non-acupuncture points on the helix of the auricles bilaterally.
No-needle relaxation control condition: Viewing relaxation videos and imagery on a large-screen television.""" ;
    tara-kb:hasCountryOfStudy "United States" ;
    tara-kb:hasDatasetLink "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupoints "Sympathetic, Lung, Liver, Shen men" ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupointsMapped TARA:2442762 ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupointsMappedCurie "{\"TARA:2442762\": \"HT 7\"}"^^rdf:JSON ;
    tara-kb:hasListedAcupointsUnmappable "Liver",
        "Lung",
        "Sympathetic" ;
    tara-kb:hasMappedWesternCondition MONDO:0005186 ;
    tara-kb:hasNeedlingDetails """Auricular Acupuncture: 1-3 mm
Needle-Insertion Control: Subcutaneous (depth not specified)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasOCSIAppraisalID tara-kb:O-112625-980 ;
    tara-kb:hasReportingPublicationID tara-kb:A-112625-980 ;
    tara-kb:hasSampleSizeDetails """Total sample size: 82
Auricular acupuncture group: 28
Needle-insertion control group: 27
Relaxation control group: 27
Completers:
Auricular acupuncture: 13
Needle-insertion control: 17
Relaxation control: 22""" ;
    tara-kb:hasShamAcupunctureDetails """Needle type: Real needles (same type and size as active acupuncture)
Quantity: Four needles
Size: Not specified
Location: Helix of the auricles at three zones not commonly used for treatment
Penetration: Subcutaneous at an oblique angle, not into cartilage""" ;
    tara-kb:hasStimulationTypeDetails "The stimulation involved the insertion of needles into specific auricular zones to a depth of 1 to 3 mm, with the aim of inducing de qi-associated sensations such as warmth and radiating sensations. No additional stimulation methods like manual manipulation, electrical stimulation, thermal stimulation, or laser stimulation were mentioned." ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedTCMCondition "Not specified" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudiedWesternCondition "Cocaine addiction" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyFindings "Yes" ;
    tara-kb:hasStudyOutcomesMeasure """Primary Outcome: Cocaine use assessed by 3-times-weekly urine toxicology screens.
Secondary Outcomes:
Analysis of urine data from treatment completers (abstinence status and duration of cocaine-negative urine samples)
Change in ASI severity of addiction and SOCRATES motivation scores
Acute subjective effects: pain, relaxation, satisfaction, willingness to pay, duration of treatment effects
Survival time to dropout (Kaplan-Meier method and log-rank test)""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentDuration """Duration of each acupuncture session: 40 minutes
Duration needles were left in place: Not specified""" ;
    tara-kb:hasTreatmentFrequency "The frequency of treatment was 5 times weekly, with each session lasting 40 minutes, administered Monday through Friday for 8 weeks." .

