    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "facial paralysis, trismus, swelling of the cheek, facial pain, toothache." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the face, anterior to the angle of the mandible, in the depression anterior to the masseter attachment, over the facial artery." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Avoid puncturing the artery. Puncture obliquely 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
