    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the upper back region, at the same level as the inferior border of the spinous process of the second thoracic vertebra (T2), 3 B-cun lateral to the posterior median line. Note: BL41 and BL12 are located at the same level as the inferior border of the spinous process of the second thoracic vertebra (T2)." ;
