    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the head, 2 B-cun superior to the anterior hairline, on the anterior median line." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture subcutaneously 0.3-0.5 inch. This point is prohibited in infants with metopism. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
