    rdfs:label "disease by etiologic mechanism" ;
    IAO:0000115 "A grouping class for human diseases classified by their etiologic mechanism, encompassing primarily intrinsic (genetic, genomic), primarily extrinsic (e.g., infections, toxins, radiation), and complex multifactorial (e.g. nutritional) causes." ;
