UBERON:0002090 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "postcranial axial skeleton" ;
    IAO:0000115 "The postcranial subdivision of skeleton structural components forming the long axis of the vertebrate body; in Danio, consisting of the notochord, vertebrae, ribs, supraneurals, intermuscular bones, and unpaired median fins; in human consists of the bones of the vertebral column, the thoracic cage and the pelvis[ZFA+FMA]." ;
