    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The plantar digital proprial nerve and the lateral dorsal cutaneous nerve of foot." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "headache, neck rigidity, blurred vision, epistaxis, mania." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the little toe, in the depression distal and lateral to the fifth metatarsophalangeal joint, at the border between the red and white flesh." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.2-0.3 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
