    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "pain in the neck, chest, thigh and hypochondriac region, rabies." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the fibular aspect of the leg, anterior to the fibula, 7 B-cun proximal to the prominence of the lateral malleolus. Note: GB36 is located 1 B-cun distal to the midpoint of the line connecting the prominence of the lateral malleolus and the lateral end of the popliteal crease, anterior to GB35." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-0.8 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
