    tara-ap:hasChineseLabel "魂門(门)" ;
    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0008231 ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "pain in the chest and hypochondriac region, back pain, vomiting, diarrhea." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the upper back region, at the same level as the inferior border of the spinous process of the ninth thoracic vertebra (T9), 3 B-cun lateral to the posterior median line. Note: BL47, BL18 and GV8 are located at the same level as the inferior border of the spinous process of the ninth thoracic vertebra (T9)." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture obliquely 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
