    tara-ap:hasChineseLabel "京門(门)" ;
    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0000916 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The eleventh intercostal nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "abdominal distension, borborygmus, diarrhea, pain in the lumbar and hypochondriac region." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the lateral abdomen, inferior to the free extremity of the 12th rib. Note: GB 25 can be located while the subject is lying on the side with the shoulder flexed. The free extremity of the 12th rib can be palpated below the inferior border of the costal arch posterior to the posterior axillary line." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
