    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "Knee pain, weakness of the foot and leg, paralysis." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the depression of the midpoint of the superior patellar border." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.1-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
