    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "epilepsy, stiffness of the back, gastric pain." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the upper back region, in the depression inferior to the spinous process of the ninth thoracic vertebra (T9), on the posterior median line." ;
