    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the head, just superior to the auricular apex. Note: With the auricle folded forward and pressed against the head, the point is located where the auricular apex touches the head." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture subcutaneously 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
