    tara-ap:hasChineseLabel "下髎(髎)" ;
    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0005473 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "On the course of the posterior ramus of the fourth sacral nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "low back pain, lower abdominal pain, dysuria, constipation, morbid leukorrhea." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the sacral region, in the fourth posterior sacral foramen. Note: The fourth posterior sacral foramen is located in the second depression, moving downward from BL32, at the same level as the sacral hiatus." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.8-1.2 inches. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Xialiao" ;
