    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0003823 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The sural nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "heavy sensation of the head, headache, low back pain, redness and swelling of the external malleolus, paralysis of the lower extremities." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the posterolateral aspect of the leg, between the fibula and the calcaneal tendon, at the same level as 3 B-cun proximal to BL60." ;
