    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation ILX:0795301 ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "pain in the cardiac region and the chest, nausea, mental disorder, epilepsy." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the upper abdomen, 1 B-cun inferior to the xiphisternal junction, on the anterior median line." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture obliquely downward 0.4-0.6 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
