    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "headache, redness and pain of the eye, failing of vision, lacrimation, deviation of the eye and mouth." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the head, in the depression, 0.5 B-cun lateral to the outer canthus of the eye." ;
