    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation ILX:0795319 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The accessory nerve and the branch of the suprascapular nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "pain in the shoulder and elbow, stiffness of the neck." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "In the scapular region, in the depression superior to the superior angle of the scapula. Note: With the upper limb hanging by the side of trunk in a seated position, TE15 is located midway between gB21 and SI13." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Tianliao" ;
