    tara-ap:hasChineseLabel "孔最" ;
    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0002386 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The lateral antebrachial cutaneous nerve and the superficial ramus of the radial nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "cough, pain in the chest, asthma, hemoptysis, sore throat, spasmodic pain of the elbow and arm." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the anterolateral aspect of the forearm, on the line connecting LU5 with LU9, 7 B- cun superior to the palmar wrist crease. Note: LU6 is 5 B-cun inferior to LU5, 1 B-cun superior to the midpoint of the line connecting LU5 with LU9." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-1 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
