    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "irregular menstruation, dysmenorrhea, dysuria, abdominal pain, diarrhea." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the lower abdomen, 3 B-cun inferior to the centre of the umbilicus, 0.5 B-cun lateral to the anterior median line." ;
