    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the palm of the hand, in the depression between the fourth and fifth metacarpal bones, proximal to the fifth metacarpophalangeal joint. Note: Between the fourth and fifth metacarpal bones, where the tip of the little finger rests when a fist is made, at the same level as PC8." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
