MONDO:0005665 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Bell's palsy" ;
    IAO:0000115 "Partial or complete paralysis of the facial muscles of one side of a person's face. It is caused by damage to the seventh cranial nerve. It is usually temporary but it may recur." ;
