    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the anterolateral aspect of the arm, just lateral to the border of the biceps brachii muscle, 3 B-cun inferior to the anterior axillary fold. Note: Longitudinally, LU3 is located at the same level as the junction of the upper one third and lower two thirds of the line con- necting the level with anterior axillary fold to LU5." ;
