    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation ILX:0795301 ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "stomachache, abdominal distension, nausea, vomiting, epilepsy, insomnia." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the upper abdomen, 5 B-cun superior to the centre of the umbilicus, on the anterior median line." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-1.2 inches. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
