MONDO:0006862 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "myofascial pain syndrome" ;
    IAO:0000115 "Muscular pain in numerous body regions that can be reproduced by pressure on trigger points, localized hardenings in skeletal muscle tissue. Pain is referred to a location distant from the trigger points. A prime example is the temporomandibular joint dysfunction syndrome." ;
