    OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym "neuropathy",
        "peripheral nerve disorder",
        "peripheral neuropathy" ;
    rdfs:comment "Editor note: NCIT draws a distinction between neuropathy and peripheral neuropathy see https://github.com/NCI-Thesaurus/thesaurus-obo-edition/issues/20. Also, location of occurrence may also include optic nerve which is not PNS." ;
