    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the posterior aspect of the forearm, midpoint of the interosseous space between the radius and the ulna, 3 B-cun proximal to the dorsal wrist crease. Note: 1 B-cun proximal to TE5, between the radius and the ulna, at the same level as tE7." ;
    tara-ap:hasMethodDescription "Puncture perpendicularly 0.8-1.2 inches. Moxibustion is applicable." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Zhigou" ;
    tara-ap:hasSpecialPointRole TARA:7315457 ;
