    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The inferior gluteal nerve, the posterior femoral cutaneous nerve and the sciatic nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "pain in the lumbosacral region, muscular atrophy, motor impairment of the lower extremities, dysuria, swelling around external genitalia, hemorrhoids, constipation." ;
