    tara-ap:hasChineseLabel "列缺" ;
    tara-ap:hasGeneralSurfaceLocation UBERON:0002386 ;
    tara-ap:hasInnervationInformation "The lateral antebrachial cutaneous nerve and the superficial ramus of the radial nerve." ;
    tara-ap:hasListedIndications "headache, migraine, neck rigidity, cough, asthma, sore throat, facial paralysis, toothache, pain and weakness of the wrist." ;
    tara-ap:hasLocationalDescription "On the radial aspect of the forearm, between the tendons of the abductor pollicis longus and the extensor pollicis brevis muscles, in the groove for the abductor pollicis longus tendon, 1.5 B-cun superior to the palmar wrist crease." ;
    tara-ap:hasPinyinLabel "Lieque" ;
